<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Kings</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kings</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba thih hnuin Moab-ho chu Israel-te chungah an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Ahazia chu Samari khuaa a pindan chungnung kawkalh tukverhah a tla thla a, a intina ta a; tichuan, mi a tîr a, an hnênah, “Kal ta ula, he ka nâ hi ka ṭha chhuak leh thei ang emaw Ekron khaw pathian Baal-zebuba va râwn teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa vântirhkohvin Tisbe mi Elija hnênah, “Tho la, Samari khaw lal mi tirhte lo be tûrin han kal la; tin, an hnênah, ‘Israel ramah hian Pathian a awm tâk loh vângin em ni Ekron khaw pathian Baal-zebuba chu râwn tûra in kal ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti a ni: “Khuma i kai kha i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang a, i thi ngei ngei ang,” tiin,’ ti rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, Elija chu a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a mi tirhte chu a hnênah an lo lêt a, ani chuan an hnênah, “Engtizia nge in lo kîr leh mai?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Mi pakhat min be tûrin a lo kal a, kan hnênah, ‘Kal ta ula, rawn tîrtu che u lal hnênah chuan kîr leh ta ula, a hnênah, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: Israel ramah hian Pathian a awm tâk loh vângin em ni Ekron khaw pathian Baal-zebuba chu râwn tûra i tirh ni? Chutichuan, khuma i kai kha i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang a, i thi ngei ngei ang, tiin,” ti rawh,’ a ti a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Rawn be tûr che ua lo kal, chûng thu rawn hrilhtu che u chu mi eng ang nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an chhâng a, “Sahmul puana inthuam mi a ni a, a kâwng savun kâwnghrênin a hrêng,” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Tisbe mi Elija a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan sipai sawmnga hotu, a hote sawmnga nên a hnênah a tîr ta a. Tin, a hnênah a han chho va; tin, ngai teh, ani chu tlâng chhîpah hian a lo ṭhu a. Tin, ani chuan, “Nang, Pathian mi, lalin, ‘Lo chhuk rawh,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan a chhâng a, sipai sawmnga hotu hnênah chuan, “Pathian mi ka nih zet chuan vân ata mei lo tla thla sela, nangmah leh i hote sawmnga kha rawn kâng ral vek che u rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, vân ata mei a lo tla a, amah leh a hote sawmnga chu an kâng ral ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah sipai sawmnga hotu dang, a hote sawmnga nên a tîr leh a. Ani chu a han chho va, a hnênah, “Nang Pathian mi, lalin, ‘Lo chhuk thuai rawh,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Pathian mi ka nih zet chuan vân ata mei lo tla thla sela, nangmah leh i hote sawmnga kha rawn kâng ral vek che u rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, Pathian mei chu vân ata a lo tla a, amah leh a hote sawmnga chu an kâng ral ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, sipai sawmnga dang hotu, a hote sawmnga nên a tîr leh pek a. Tin, chu mi sipai sawmnga dang hotu chu a han chho va, Elija hmaah chuan a han ṭhingṭhi a, a hnênah, “Aw Pathian mi, ka nunna leh hêng i chhiahhlawh mi sawmngate nunna hi i mit hmuhah hian lo hlu teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, vân ata mei a lo tla a, sipai sawmnga hotute pahnih kha an hote sawmnga nên khân an lo kâng ral ta a; keia nunna erawh hi chu i mit hmuhah hian lo hlu teh se,” tiin a han ngen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Elija hnênah, “A rual hian chhuk rawh, amah chu hlau suh,” a ti a. Tin, a tho va, lal hnênah an chhuk dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Ekron khaw pathian Baal-zebuba râwn tûra mite i tirh vei hi, Israel ramah hian Pathian râwn tûr a awm tâk loh vâng em ni le? Chuvângin, khuma i kai kha i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang a, i thi ngei ngei ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elijan a sawi Lalpa thu ang chuan Ahazia chu a thi ta a. Tin, fapa a neih loh avângin Juda lal Jehosaphata fapa Jehorama kum hnih a lal kum chuan Jehorama chu a aiawhin a lal ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahazia thiltih chanchin dangte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Elija chu vânah ṭhâwngaleivira a hruai chhoh dâwn vêl chuan heti hi a ni a, Elija chu Elisa nên Gilgal aṭangin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Elijan Elisa hnênah, “Hetah hian lo awm rawh khai; Lalpan Bethel thlenga kal tûrin mi tîr a ni,” a ti a. Tin, Elisa chuan, “ Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Bethel-ah an chhuk dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Bethel-a awm zâwlneiho fapate chu Elisa hnênah an kal a, a hnênah, “Vawiinah hian Lalpan i chunga hotu hi a lâk bosak dâwn che tih i hria em?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Aw, ka hria asin; ngawi mai rawh u!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan a hnênah, “Elisa, hetah hian lo awm rawh khai; Lalpan Jeriko-a kal tûrin mi tîr a ni,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Jeriko-ah chuan an kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko-a awm zâwlneiho fapate chuan Elisa chu an va hnaih a, a hnênah, “Vawiinah hian Lalpan i chunga hotu hi a lâk bosak dâwn che tih i hria em?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Aw, ka hria asin; ngawi mai rawh u!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan a hnênah, “Hetah hian lo awm rawh khai; Lalpan Jordan-a kal tûrin mi tîr a ni,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, an pahnih chuan an kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, zâwlneiho fapate zînga mi sawmnga chu an va kal a, anmahni epin hla fêah an va ding a; tin, anni pahnih chu Jordan lui kamah an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan a puan chu a la a, a tumtêl a, tui chu a han vua a, lehlam lehlamah a lo inṭhen ta a; tichuan, an pahnih chuan lei chârah an kal kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, an kai hnu chuan heti hi a ni a, Elija chuan Elisa hnênah, “I hnên ata lâk bova ka awm hma hian eng nge ka tihsak ang che, mi dîl rawh,” a ti a. Tin, Elisa chuan, “I thlarau chan hnih chang ila,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Thil khirh tak i dîl a nih hi; khirh mah sela, i hnên ata lâk bova ka awm lai mi hmuh chuan i chang ang a, mi hmuh loh erawh chuan i chang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an kal dûn zêl a, an tîtî lai chuan heti hi a ni a, ngai teh, meitawlailîr leh meisakawrte a lo lang ta phut a, an kâra tlain a inṭhentîr ta a; tin, Elija chu ṭhâwngaleiviran vânah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Elisa chuan a hmu a, “Ka pa, ka pa, Israel-te tawlailîr leh sakawr chung chuang mite hentu!” tiin a au va. Tin, Elija chu a hmu ta lo va; tichuan, ama puan chu a chelh a, hmun hnihah a pawt thlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elija puan lo tla pawh chu a khai a, a lêt leh a, Jordan lui kamah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Elija puan lo tla chu a la a, tui chu a han vua a, “ Lalpa , Elija Pathian chu khawiah nge?” a ti a. Tin, tui a han vuak ve chuan lehlam lehlamah a lo inṭhen ta a, Elisa chu a kal kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko khuaa zâwlneiho fapa, amah epa awmten an han hmuh chuan, “Elija thlarau chu Elisa chungah a fu ta ngei mai le,” an ti a. Amah be tûrin an va kal a, a hmaah chuan lei siin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh hei, i chhiahhlawhte hian mi ngalchak tak tak sawmnga kan awmpui a; i pu zawng tûrin tîr rawh khai; Lalpa thlarauvin a hruai chho ta ang a, khawii lai tlângah emaw, khawii lai ruamah emaw a thlâk ta mai te hi a ni ang e,” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Kaltîr lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a tân zahthlâk khawpa an ngen hnu chuan, “Kaltîr ta che u,” a ti ta a. Chutichuan, mi sawmnga an tîr a, ni thum an zawng a; nimahsela, an hmu zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko khuaa a la châm lai chuan a hnênah an lo kîr leh a; ani chuan an hnênah, “In hnênah khân, ‘Kal suh u,’ ka ti che u a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chumi khuaa mite chuan Elisa hnênah, “En teh, hei, he khaw hmun hi a nuam hle mai a, kan pu pawhin i hmu ve reng a; nimahsela, tui hi a ṭha lo va, a ram pawh hi nau chhiatna ram a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Tuithâwl thar mi han lâk ula, chi han thun teh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, an rawn lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, tuikhurah a va kal a, chu chu a han theh lût a, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘He tui hi ka titui tawh e, tûn achinah chuan thihna leh nau chhiatna a awm tawh lo vang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elisa sawi angin tûn thlengin tui chu a tui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan Bethel-ah a han chho va; tin, chumi kawnga a kal lai chuan khua ata mipa naupangho an lo chhuak a, an rawn nuihzat a, a hnênah, “Nang lukawlhpa, han chho tawh! Nang lukawlhpa, han chho tawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a han lehhawi a, anmahni chu a han hmu a. Lalpa hmingin ânchhia a lawh ta a. Tin, ramhnuai ata savawmnu pahnih an lo chhuak a, an zînga naupang sawmli leh pahnih an rawn seh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan Karmel tlângah a kal a, chuta ṭang chuan Samari khuaah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehosaphata kum sâwm leh kum riat a lal kumin, Ahaba fapa Jehorama chu Israel-ho chungah Samari khuaah a lal ṭan a; tin, kum sâwm leh kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuhah thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; amaherawhchu, a nu leh a pa ang êm zawngin thil a ti lo; ani zawngin a pain Baala lung a lo phun kha a paih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnaahte chuan a bet tlat a; a kalsan leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab lal Mesa chu berâm vulh mi a ni a; ani chuan Israel lal lakah berâmno nuai khat hmul leh berâmpa nuai khat hmul chhiahah a chawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Ahaba thih hnu chuan heti hi a ni a, Moab lal chu Israel lal chungah a hel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai chuan Lal Jehorama chu Samari khua ata a chhuak a, Israel-ho zawng zawng chu a khâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, a chhuak a, Juda lal Jehosaphata hnênah, “Moab lal ka chungah a hel a, Moab-ho mi han beihpui duh ang emaw chu?” tiin mi a tîr a. Tin, ani chuan, “Han beihpui e a; kei leh nang, ka mite leh i mite chu pumkhat kan ni a, ka sakawrte leh i sakawrte chu pumkhat an ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, amah vêk chuan, “Khawi lam kawngah nge kan han kal ang?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Edom thlalêr lam kawngah le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal chu Juda lal nên, Edom lal nên an kal ta a, ni sarih an kal kual a; tin, sipaihote leh an sa hruaite in tûr tui a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan, “E khai aw! Lalpan lal pathumte hi Moab-ho kuta pêk tûrin min hruai khâwm a ni ngei mai le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehosaphata chuan, “Hetah hian Lalpa min râwnsak tûr Lalpa zâwlnei tu emaw tal an awm lâwm ni?” a ti a. Tin, Israel lal chhiahhlawh pakhat chuan a chhâng a, “Elija kut tuia leih thîntu Saphata fapa Elisa hetah hian a awm asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan, “A hnênah chuan Lalpa thu a awm mai chu,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Israel lal leh Jehosaphata leh Edom lal chu a hnênah an zuk kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan Israel lal hnênah chuan, “Nang leh keiin inhmanna eng nge kan neih le? I pa zâwlneite hnênah leh i nu zâwlneite hnênah kal daih tawh,” a ti a. Tin, Israel lal chuan a hnênah, “Kal lo ve; lal pathumte hi Moab-ho kuta pêk tûrin Lalpan min hruai khâwm a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Elisan, “A bula ka awm ṭhinna Sipaihote Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Juda lal Jehosaphata hi zah lo ni ila chuan i lam pawh ka hawi duhin, hmuh pawh ka hmu duh hlek lo tûr che a nia le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, ṭingṭang tum thiam mi han koh ta che u,” a ti a. Tin, ṭingṭang tum thiamin a han tum chuan, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa kut chu a chungah a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Hemi ruam zawng zawng hi lai khuar thliah rawh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa vêkin heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Thli rêng rêng in hre lo vang a, ruah rêng rêng pawh in hmu hek lo vang; nimahsela, hemi ruam hi tuiin a khat vek ang; tichuan, nangni leh in ran rualte leh in sate hian in tlân ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpa ngaih chuan thil tê tham mai a ni a; Moab-ho hi in kutah a pe bawk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, kulhpui nei khua zawng zawng leh khawpui ṭha zawng zawng chu in tichhia ang a, thing ṭha zawng zawng chu in kit ang a, tuikhur zawng zawng chu in hnawh ping ang a, hmun ṭha lai zawng zawng chu lungin in vawm chhe vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zîngah, thilhlan hun vêl lai chuan heti hi a ni a, ngai teh, Edom ram lam aṭangin tui a lo luang chiam a, a ram chu tuiin a lo khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Moab-ho zawng zawng chuan anmahni bei tûrin lalho an lo thawk chho tih an lo hriat chuan, râlkai chin zawng zawng an inko khâwm chiam a, ramriah an lo ṭang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, zîng takah an tho va, niin tui chu a zuk chhun a; tin, Moab-ho chuan an zâwna tui chu thisen ang maia sen kûkin an han hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thisen a nih saw, lalho hi anmahni leh anmahni an indo va, anmahni leh anmahni an inthat a ni ngei mai le; hawh u, Moab-hote u, râllâk sum i va chuh ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho riahhmun an va thlen chuan, Israel-ho chu an tho phut mai a, Moab-ho chu an bei a; tichuan, an hmaah an tlânchhe ta chiam a; tin, Moab-ho that chung zêlin an ramah an ûm lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, khuate chu an tichhia a; an hmun ṭha lai zawng zawng chu mi tinin an vawm a, lungin a khat ta vek a; tin, tuikhur zawng zawng an hnawh ping a, thing ṭha zawng zawng an kit a; Kir-hareseth khuaa mi chauh a ni, lung chu an khawih loh ni; chu pawh chu virvawma vawm miin an hual a, an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Moab lal chuan an indo chu chelh dâwnin a inhre ta lo va, Edom lal hnên thleng tûra tâwn tlang tumin khandaih keng mi zasarih a hruai chhuak a; nimahsela, an thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, a fapa upa ber, a aia la lal tûra chu kulh tlângah chuan hâlral thilhlanah a hmang ta a. Tin, Israel-hote chungah chuan an thinrim ta êm êm mai a, an kîrsan a, an ram lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zâwlneite fapaho nupuite zînga hmeichhe pakhat hian Elisa hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh, ka pasal chu a lo thi ta a; tin, i chhiahhlawh khân Lalpa chu a ṭih ṭhîn tih i hria a. Hei a leibatna chu ka fate pahnih bâwih atâna hruai tûrin a lo kal a ni,” tiin a mangan thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Eng nge ka tihsak ang che? Mi hrilh teh, inah eng nge i neih?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “I bâwihnu hian sahriak ûm khat chauh lo chu inah eng mah ka nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “Va kal ta la, i ṭhenawmteho zawng zawng bêl, bêl ruak va hawh khâwm tawh khai; tlêm tê mai zawng hawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lût la, nang leh i fate nên kawng inkhâr khum ula; chûng bêl zawng zawngah chuan thun langin, a khat chu dah hrang zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hnên ata chu a kal ta a, amah leh a fapate nên chuan kawng an inkhâr khum a; anni chuan bêlte chu an rawn la a, ani chuan a lo thun zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, bêlte chu a khah hnu chuan, heti hi a ni a, a fapaa hnênah, “Bêl mi han lâk leh rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Bêl a awm tawh lo,” a ti a. Tin, sahriak chu a kang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian mi chu a va hrilh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Va kal la, sahriak chu va zuar ta la, i leiba chu va rûl langin, a bâk chuan i fapate nên va khawsa tawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ni khat chu Elisa chu Sunem khuaah a va zin a, chutah chuan hmeichhe neinung tak a awm a; ani chuan chaw ei tûrin a lo kai lût a. Chutichuan, a kal apiangin chutah chuan chaw ei tûrin a lût ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a pasala hnênah, “Ngai teh hei, he mi, mi rawn pal fo ṭhîntu hi Pathian mi thianghlim a ni tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hawh teh, in chhâwng tê i siamsak ang khai; khum te, dawhkân te, ṭhutphah te, khâwnvâr dahna te i dahsak ang; tichuan, kan hnêna a lo kal apiang hian a lût ṭhîn dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ni khat chu a va kal leh a, chumi in chhâwngah chuan a va lût a, a mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawh Gehazia hnênah, “He Sunam nu hi han ko teh,” a ti a. Tin, a va koh hnu chuan a hmaah a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “ ‘Ngai teh, nangin hei theihtâwpin min duat a, eng nge kan tihsak ve ang che? Lal emaw, sipai hotu emaw biaksak che i duh em?’ tiin a hnênah hian sawi teh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Mahni chipuite zînga chêng ka ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Eng emaw chu kan tihsak tâk ang?” a ti a. Tin, Gehazia chuan a chhâng a, “Fapa chu a nei hauh lo mai a le, a pasal lah chu a tar tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Va ko teh,” a ti a. Tin, a va koh hnu chuan kawngkaah a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Tûn ang hun a lo thlen leh tikah chuan fapa i pawm tawh ang,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “A, ka pu, nang Pathian mi, i bâwihnu lakah hian daw ma ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu a rai a, Elisan a hnêna a sawi ang ngei khân chumi hun a lo thlen leh chuan fapa a hring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, nausên chu a lo sei lian a, ni khat chu a pa hnênah buh latute hnênan a kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a pa hnênah chuan, “Ka lu, ka lu,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “A nu hnênah pawm tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a hruai a, a nu hnên a thlen chuan a mal chungah chhûnlai thlengin a ṭhu a; tichuan, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a chho va, Pathian mi khumah chuan a han mut a, kawng a khâr khum a, a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a pasal chu a au va, “Chhiahhlawh tu emaw leh sabengtung pakhat emaw mi han ngaihtuahsak teh, Pathian mi hnênah ka va tlân ang a, ka lo kîr leh ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Eng atân nge vawiin khera a hnêna kal i tum? Thla thar pawh a la ni lo va, Chawlhni pawh a la ni si lo va,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “A rem mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, sabengtung a thuam a, a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Tlântîr la, kal zêl rawh khai; thu ka pêk loh che chuan mi timuang hauh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, a kal ta a, Pathian mi hnênah chuan Karmel tlângah a va kal a. Tîn, Pathian mi chuan hla tak aṭanga a lo hmuh chuan, heti hi a ni a, a chhiahhlawh Gehazia hnênah, “En teh, sawta saw Sunem nu kha a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />amah hmuak tûrin va tlân la, a hnênah, ‘I dam em le? I pasal a dam em? Naupang kha a dam em?’ lo va ti tawh khai,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a lo chhâng a, “Dam e,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, tlânga Pathian mi hnên a han thlen chuan a ke a han vuan ta tlat a. Tin, amah chu rawn nam kian tumin Gehazia chuan a va pan a; nimahsela, Pathian mi chuan, “Eng mah tih suh, a rilru a mangang a nih hi; Lalpan ka lakah a la thup rih a, mi la hrilh rih lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “Ka pu hi fapa ka dîl che em kha? ‘Mi tihder suh ang che,’ ka ti lâwm ni kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Gehazia hnênah, “I puan veng la, ka tiang hi kengin va kal tawh khai. Tu pawh va hmu la, chibai bûk suh ang che; tin, tu pawhin chibai an bûk che chuan bûk ve kher suh ang che; tin, ka tiang hi naupang hmaiah nghat ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, naupang nu chuan, “ Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka thlah dâwn tawp lo che a ni,” a ti a. Tin, a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Gehazia chuan anni chu a lo hmakhalh a, tiang chu naupang hmaiah chuan a han nghat a; nimahsela, awkâ leh hriat theihna rêng rêng a nei lo va. Chutichuan, a be tûrin a kîr leh a. “Naupang chu a meng hauh lo mai,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu ina a va luh chuan ngai teh, naupang chu a lo thi tawh reng a, a khumah chuan an lo la mut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, a va lût a, an pahnih chuan kawng a khâr hnan a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a han lâwn a, naupang chu a bawhkhuh a, a hmui leh a hmui, a mit leh a mit, a kut leh a kut a chuktuah a; tin, a chungah chuan a kaikûn a; tichuan, naupang taksa chu a lo lum ta tial tial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, a zuk chhuk leh a, in chhûngah chuan a han vei a; tin, a han lâwn a, a chungah chuan a han kaikûn leh a; tichuan, naupang chu vawi sarih a han hahchhiau va, naupang chu a lo meng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Gehazia a ko va, “He Sunem nu hi han ko teh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a va ko va. Tin, a hnêna a va luh chuan, “I fapa hi pawm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, a va lût a, a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a; tin, a fapa chu a pawm a, a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu Gilgal-ah a kal leh a, chumi ramah chuan ṭam a tla a. Tin, zâwlneiho fapate chu a hmaah an ṭhu khâwm a; a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Bêl lian tak kha chhuang langin, zâwlneiho fapate hi thil chhumkawi chhumsak rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat ram lamah chawhmeh zawng tûrin a va kal a, ram hrui hi a va hmu a, chuta mi ram âwmpâwng chu a puan tlin tâwkin a rawn fûn a, a zai sawm a, bêla thil chhumkawiah chuan a thlâk ta a; eng tih an hre hauh lo mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, chu miteho ei atân chuan an han suak chhuak a. Tin, thil chhumkawi chu an han ei chuan, heti hi a ni a, “E khai, Pathian mi, bêl chhûngah hian thihna a awm alâwm le,” an ti ta chûl mai a. Tichuan, an ei thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chhangphut han la teh u,” a ti a. Tin, chu chu bêlah a han thlâk a, “He mite eiah hian han suak chhuak teh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, bêlah chuan hlauhawm eng mah a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Baal-salisa aṭangin mi pakhat a lo kal a, Pathian mi chu buh thar hmasa bera siam buhsanghar chhangpêr sawmhnih leh buh thar vui a ipin a rawn kensak a. Ani chuan, “He miteho ei atân hian pe ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawh chuan, “Eng â ni? Hei hi mi za zet ka hlui ang maw?” a ti a. Ani erawh chuan, “He miteho ei atân hian pe rawh; Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘An ei ang a, an ei bâng bawk ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chutichuan, a han hlui a, an ei a, Lalpa tih ang ngeiin an ei bâng bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suria lal sipai hotu Naamana chu Lalpan Suria-hote chhanhimtua a hman ṭhin avângin, a pu ngaiha ropui leh mi zahawm tak a ni a; amah chu mi chak huaisen a ni bawk a, phâr a ni pawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suria-hote chu a pâwl pâwlin an rammu a, Israel ram aṭangin hmeichhe naupang tê hi salah an rawn hâwn a; ani chuan Naamana nupui rawng a bâwl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a pi hnênah, “Ka pu hi Samari khuaa zâwlnei hmaah va kal sela ka va ti êm ve aw! A phâr hi a lo tidam mai tûr a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Naamana chu a va lût a, “Israel rama hmeichhe naupang tê khân chutiang khatiang chuan a ti e,” tiin a pu chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal chuan, “Va kal tak rawh khai, Israel lal hnênah lehkha ka thawn ang e,” a ti a. Tichuan, a chhuak ta a, tangkarua talent sâwm leh, rangkachak tlang sângruk leh silhfên inthlâkna tûr sâwm a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, “He lehkha hi i lo hmu ang a, ngai teh, ka puipa Naamana hi a phâr i lo tihdamsak tûrin i hnênah ka rawn tîr a ni e,” tihna lehkha chu Israel lal a va pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israel lalin chu lehkha chu a han chhiar chuan heti hi a ni a, a puan a pawt thlêr a, “Mite tihlum theia, tinung leh thei ṭhîn Pathian em ka niha, he mi hian phâr tidam tûra ka hnêna a rawn tirh ngawt mai hi le? Ngaihtuah ula, ka chungah remchâng a zawng a ni tih hre rawh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi Elisan Israel lalin a puan a pawt thlêr tih a lo hriat chuan, heti hi a ni a. “Eng vângin nge i puan i pawh thlêr? Ka hnênah lo kal ang hmiang; tichuan, Israel ramah hian zâwlnei a awm tih a hre mai ang chu,” tiin lal hnênah mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Naamana chu a sakawrte nên, a tawlailîrte nên chuan a va kal a, Elisa in kawngka bulah chuan a va ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan, “Jordan luiah vawi sarih va inbual la, i tisa ngai i pu leh ang a, i lo thianghlim tawh ang,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Naamana chu a thinrim ta hle mai a, a kal leh ta a, “Ngai teh u, amah ngei chu ka hnênah a lo chhuak ang a, a lo ding ang a, Lalpa a Pathian hming chu a han lam ang a, a phâr lai chunga a kut thênin phâr hi a han tidam dâwn emaw ka ti asin le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaska khaw lui Abana te, Pharpar te chu Israel ram lui zawng zawng aiin a ṭha zâwk lo vem ni? Chûngah chuan inbualin ka intithianghlim thei lo vem ni?” a ti a. Chutichuan, a lehhawi a, thinrim zetin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawhte chuan an va hnaih a, an va bia a, “Ka pa, zâwlnei khân thil khirhkhân tak tihtîr dâwn ta che sela, i ti mai dâwn lâwm ni? ‘Va inbual la, va intithianghlim rawh,’ i hnêna a han ti kha tih zâwk âwm tak a ni lâwm ni le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, a zuk chhuk a, Pathian mi sawi ang chuan Jordan luiah vawi sarih a zuk inhnim a; tin, a tisa chu nausên tisa ang mai a lo ni leh a, a lo thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, amah leh a hote zawng zawng nên chuan Pathian mi awmna lamah an kîr leh a, a hmaah an va ding a; tin, ani chuan, “Ngai teh hei, Israel ramah ngawt lo chuan leilung zawng zawngah hian Pathian a lo awm lo ve tih ka hre ta; chutichuan, i chhiahhlawh lâwmman hi la teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “A bula ka awm ṭhinna Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, eng mah hi ka la lo vang,” a ti a. Tichuan, la tûrin a thlêm chiam a; nimahsela, a duh lo tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Naamana chuan, “A nih loh leh, i chhiahhlawh hi sabengtung pahnih phur lei mi lâktîr rawh khai; tûn achinah zawng i chhiahhlawh hian Lalpa hnênah ngawt lo chuan, hâlral thilhlan leh inthawina rêng rêng hi, pathian dangte hnênah ka hlân dâwn tawh hauh lo a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He thilah hian Lalpan i chhiahhlawh hi ngaidam rawh se: ka pu hi ka kut rinchhana chibai bûk tûra Rimona ina a luha, Rimona ina ka kûn chuan, Rimona ina ka kûn ve thûah chuan, Lalpan i chhiahhlawh hi ngaidam rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a hnên ata chu a chhuak leh a, eng emaw chen a kal hman a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian mi Elisa chhiahhlawh Gehazia chuan, “Khawinge, ka pu hian Suria mi Naamana hi a thil rawn kente la hlek lovin a chhuah leh ta mai a; Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka va ûm ang a, eng emaw tal ka va lâksak teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gehazia chuan Naamana chu a ûm ta a. Tin, Naamanan tuin emaw a rawn ûm a han hmuh chuan, lo biak tumin tawlailîr ata chu a chhuk a, “Ṭha lam thu alâwm maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ṭha lam thu ni e. Ka puin, ‘Ngai teh hei, Ephraim tlâng ram aṭangin zâwlneiho fapate zînga tlangvâl pahnihin mi rawh tlawh ta thut mai a, anni chu tangkarua talent khat leh silhfên inthlâkna tûr pahnih pe rawh khai,’ tiin mi rawn tîr a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Naamana chuan, “Talent hnih hi la rawh khai,” a ti a. Tichuan, la tûrin a thlêm chiam a; tin, tangkarua talent hnih chu silhfên inthlâkna tûr pahnih nên chuan ip hnihah a thun a, a chhiahhlawhte pahnih a phurhtîr a, a hmaah chuan an kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, tlâng a va thlen chuan a lâksak a, in chhûngah a dah a; tin, chu mite chu a kaltîr a, an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a lût a, a pu hmaah chuan a va ding a. Tin, Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Khawi aṭangin nge i lo kal le, Gehazi?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan “I chhiahhlawh hi khawiah mah ka kal lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “A be tûr chea a tawlailîr ata kha mi lo chhuk lai khân ka rilru i hnênah a kal ve zêl a ni lâwm ni? Tangka te, silhfên te, olive huan te, grêp huan te, berâm te, sebâwngpa te, bâwihpa leh bâwihnu te hi lâk a hun em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Naamana phâr khân a man ang chia, kumkhuain i thlahte pawh a man zêl ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, a hnên ata chu vûr anga vâra phârin a kal chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, zâwlneiho fapate chuan Elisa hnênah, “En teh hei, i bula kan ṭhut khâwmna hi kan tân a chêp lutuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan luiah kan zuk kal ang a, chuta thing chu kan zuk la ṭheuh ang a, kan ṭhut khâwmna tûr chutah chuan kan zu siam teh ang aw?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Kal ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat chuan, “I chhiahhlawhte hnênah hian kal ve ta che,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ka kal ve ang e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, an hnênah a kal ve ta a. Tin, Jordan lui an thlen chuan thing chu an han kit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhatin thing a han kih lai tak chuan, hreifang chu tuiah a tla ta a; tin, ani chu, “E khai aw, ka pu! Kan hawh asin ni le,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chuan, “Khawii laiah nge a tlâk?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a tlâkna lai a entîr a. Tichuan, thingtuai a han sât a, chutah chuan a han paih lût a, thîr chu a lo lâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chhar rawh le,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a han ban a, a chhar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria lal chuan Israel-te a rûn dâwn a, “Chumi khami hmunah chuan i châng ang u,” tiin a puipateho a râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chuan Israel lal hnênah, “Chutiang hmuna kal lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh; chutah chuan Suria-ho an lo chhuk dâwn a nia,” tiin mi a tîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Pathian miin a lo hrilh tawh hmun chu mi a va en thlithlaitîr ṭhîn a. Chutah chuan vawi hnih khat chang pawh ni lovin, a lo inhumhim ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi thûah chuan Suria lal thinlung chu a mangang hle mai a; tin, a puipate chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Kan zînga mi a tu hi nge Israel lal lama ṭang mi hrilh duh dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a puipate zînga mi pakhat chuan, “Tu mah kan ṭang lo ve, aw lalber ka pu; Israel rama awm zâwlnei Elisa hian i pindan chhûngrila i sawite hi Israel lal a hrilh zêl ṭhîn a ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Khawiah nge a awm va zawng teh u, ka va mantîr ang e,” a ti a. Tin, “Ngai teh, Dothan khuaah a awm e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, sakawr te, tawlailîr te, sipai tam takte chutah chuan a tîr a, zânah an va kal a, khua chu an hual ta mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chhiahhlawh chu zîng taka a thawha, a va chhuah chuan, ngai teh, sipaiho chuan sakawr nên, tawlailîr nên khua chu an lo hual mup mai a. Tin, a chhiahhlawh chuan a hnênah, “E khai aw, ka pu! Engtin nge kan tih tâk ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Hlau ma ta che; an lama ṭang ai chuan kan lama ṭang an tam zâwk alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu a ṭawngṭai a, “ Lalpa , a hmuh theihna tûrin a mit han tihmensak teh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpan chu tlangvâl mit chu a han tihmensak a; tichuan, a hmu ve ta a. Tin, ngai teh, Elisa vêlah chuan tlâng chu mei tawlailîr leh sakawrin a khat mup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Suria-ho a lama an lo chhuk chuan Elisa chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “Hêngho hi an mit han tihdelsak teh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, Elisa thu angin an mit a rawn tihdelsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan an hnênah, “Hei chu kawng a ni lo ve, hei chu khua pawh a ni hek lo. Mi zui rawh u, in mi zawna hnênah chuan ka hruai ang che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Samari khuaah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Samari khaw chhûng an han thlen chuan heti hi a ni a, Elisan, “ Lalpa , hêngho hian an hmuh theihna tûrin an mit han tihmensak ang che,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpan an mit chu a han tihmensak a, an hmu ta a; tin, ngai teh, Samari khaw chhûngah an lo awm reng mai a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan anniho chu a hmuh chuan Elisa hnênah, “Ka pa, ka that ang em? Ka that ang em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “That lo ve a. I khandaih leh i thal ngula i sal mante chu i that dâwn em ni? Chhang leh tui han hlui langin, eiin in sela, an pu hnênah haw leh rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ei tûr tam tak a buatsaihsak a; tin, an eia an in zawh chuan a hâwntîr ta vek a, an pu hnên lamah an haw leh ta a. Tichuan, Suria-ho pâwlte chu Israel ramah chuan an rammu leh ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Suria lal Ben-hadada chuan a sipai zawng zawng a khâwm a, Samari khua a han hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Samari khuaah chuan ṭam a nasa ta êm êm mai a; tin, ngai teh, an hual tlat a, sabengtung lû hi tangkaraw sawmriatah an hralh a; tin, ṭhuro êk hi kab hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat tangkaraw ngaah an hralh hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chu kulh tlânga a kal lai hmeichhe pakhat hian, “Aw lalber, ka pu, mi pui rawh,” tiin a lo au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpan a ṭanpui nghâl loh chein keiin khawi atain nge ka han ṭanpui tehlul ang che? Hruih zâwl atain emaw, grêp sâwrna khur atain emaw em ni dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Eng i ti nge ni le?” a ti leh a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “He hmeichhia hian ka hnênah, ‘Vawiinah hian i fapa hi kan eiah thawh rawh khai, naktûkah ka fapa hi kan ei ve thung dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, ka fapa chu kan chhûm a, kan ei a; tin, a tûkah chuan keiin a hnênah, ‘I fapa chu kan eiah thawh ve thung rawh le,’ ka ti a, a fapa chu a thukru ta bîk mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lalin chu hmeichhe thusawi chu a hriatin heti hi a ni a, a puan a pawt thlêr ta a (kulh tlânga a kal lai a ni a); tin, mipuite chuan an han en a, ngai teh, a pang depah chuan saiip puan hi a lo sin reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “Vawiinah hian Saphata fapa Elisa hian a lû a la put nâ chuan Pathianin a tih tihin mi ti mai sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu a inah a ṭhu a, upahote pawh an ṭhu ve a; tin, lalber chuan a hnênah mi pakhat a tîr a; nimahsela, a mi tirh chuan a hnên a lo thlen hmain upaho hnênah chuan, “He tualthattupa fapa hian ka lû la tûrin mi a rawn tîr tih in hre ve em u? Ngawi teh u, a mi tirh chu a lo thlen veleh, kawng lo khâr ula, kawngkhâr khân lo dang tlat ang che u; a hnungah chuan a pu pên ri a hriat nghe nghe lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chutia anmahni a la biak lai mêk chuan ngai teh, a mi tirh chu a lo thleng thla ta a; tin, lalber chuan, “Ngai teh, he thil ṭha lo hi Lalpa rawn tirh a nih hi; Lalpa chu engah nge ka la ngaihchân cheu vang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elisan, “ Lalpa thu hi lo hre rawh u. Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Naktûk hetih hun vêlah hian Samari kulh kawngka bulah chuan chhangphut dip tehkhâwng khat chu sekel khatah an hralh ang a, barli tehkhâwng hnih chu sekel khatah,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, sipai hotu, lalin a kut a rawn rinchhana chuan Pathian mi chu a chhâng a, “Ngai teh, Lalpan vânah tukverh a hawn chu le! Chutiang chu a ni thei tehlul ang maw?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ngai rawh, i mit zawngin i hmu ngei ang a, a ei erawh chu i ei dâwn lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, kulh luhna kawngka bulah chuan phâr pali an awm a; anni chuan, “Eng atân nge maw thih nghâk maia kan ṭhut reng le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Khaw chhûngah i lût teh mai ang u,’ han ti dâwn ila, khaw chhûng an ṭâm a, kan va thi mai âwm si a; tin, hetah hian ṭhu reng dâwn ila, kan thi tho tho âwm bawk si a. Chutichuan, hawh teh u, Suria sipaihote hnên lamah i tlu lût rawk mai teh ang u. Min zuah leh kan nung ang a; min thah leh kan thi a ni mai ang chu,” tiin an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Suria-hote riahhmuna kal tûr chuan thimhmulah an thawk chhuak ta a; tin, Suria-ho riahhmun tawntirh an va thlen chuan, ngai teh, tu mah an lo awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpan Suria sipaihote chu tawlailîr thâwm te, sakawr thâwm te, sipai tam tak thâwm te a hriattîr a ni a; tichuan, “Ngai teh u, Israel lal hian Hit lalhote, Aigupta lalhote hi min rawn bei tûrin a ruai a nih hi,” tiin an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, an tho va, thimhmulah chuan an tlânchhe ta a, an puan inte, an sakawrte, an sabengtungte leh an riahhmun chu a awm ngai ngaiin an tlânsan a, an tlânchhe ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chûng phârho chuan riahhmun tawntirh an va thlen chuan puan in pakhatah hian an va lût a, an eiin an in a, chuta tangkarua leh rangkachak te, silhfên te chu an la a, an va thukru a; tin, an va lêt leh a, puan in dangah an lût leh a, chuta mi pawh chu an la a, an va thukru leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nakinah chuan, “Kan tidik hauh lo mai a! Vawiin hi chanchin lâwmawm thlen nî a ni a, keini hi kan ngawi reng mai a; khawvâr kan nghah chuan hrem kan tâwk mai ang; chutichuan, hawh u, lal chhûngte i va hrilh ang u,” tiin an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, khaw kawngkhâr vêngtu chu an va au va, “Suria-ho riahhmunah kan va kal a; tin, ngai teh, tu mah an lo awm lo va, mihring thâwm rêng rêng pawh a awm lo va, sakawrte leh sabengtungte chauh a lo inthlung a, puan inte pawh chu a awm ngai ngaiin a awm reng mai,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhâr vêngtute chu a ko va; tin, anni chuan lal in chhûnga mite chu an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal chu zânah chuan a tho va, a puipate hnênah chuan, “Suria-hote min tih dân hi ka hrilh teh ang che u. Kan rilṭâmzia hi an hria a; chuvângin, ‘Khawpui ata an lo chhuah chuan a nungin kan lo man ang a, khaw chhûngah kan lût dâwn zuk nia,’ tiin ramah biru tûrin an riahhmun an chhuahsan a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a puipa pakhat chuan a chhâng a, “Khawpuia sakawr awm chhunte zînga panga hi tute emaw hruaitîr rawh khai (ngai teh, Israel mipuiho, a la dam zawng zawngte ang bawk an ni tho tho va; ngai teh, Israel mipuiho thia ngaihte ang bawk an ni tho tho alâwm); tichuan, i va tîr teh rêng ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, tawlailîr hnûktu sakawr pahnih an hruai a; tin, lal chuan, “Va en teh ta u,” tiin, Suria sipaihote ûm tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jordan lui thlengin an va ûm a; tin, ngai teh, Suria-hoten an hmanhmawh avânga an paih silhfênte leh bungruate chu kawng tluanin a awm zel zul mai a. Tin, a mi tirhte chu an lo kir leh a, lal chu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mipui chu an va chhuak a, Suria-ho riahhmun chu an va suam ta chiam a. Chutichuan, Lalpa thu ang ngeiin chhangphut dip mi tehkhâwng khat chu sekel khatah an hralh a, buhsanghar tehkhâwng hnih chu sekel khatah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan sipai hotu, a kut a rawn rinchhana kha kulh kawngka vêngtuah a ruat a; tin, mipuite chuan kulh kawngka bulah chuan an chîl ta nuaih nuaih a, Pathian miin a hnêna lal a lo chhuk laia a lo sawi ang khân a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Heti hi a ni a, Pathian miin lal hnêna, “Naktûk hetih hun vêlah hian Samari kulh kawngka bulah buhsanghar tehkhâwng hnih chu sekel khatah an hralh ang a, chhangphut dip mi tehkhâwng khat chu sekel khatah,” a tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />sipai hotuin Pathian mi chu a chhâna, “Ngai teh, Lalpan vânah tukverh a hawn dâwn chu le! Chutiang chu a ni thei tehlul ang maw?” a tiha, anin, “Ngai rawh, i mit zawngin i hmu ngei ang a, a ei erawh chu i ei dâwn lo a ni,” tia a sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang ngei chuan a chungah a lo thleng ta a ni; mipuiin kulh kawngka bulah chuan an chîl nuaih nuaih a, a thi ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elisan a fapa a tihdamsak hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Tho la, nang leh i chhûngte nên, in awm theih theihna hmunah va awm rih rawh u; Lalpan ṭâm a tlâktîr dâwn e; he ramah hian kum sarih chhûng zet a tla nghe nghe dâwn a ni,” tiin a lo sawi tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, hmeichhia chu a tho va, Pathian mi thu ang chuan a ti a; a chhûngte nên chuan Philistia-ho ramah kum sarih an va awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, kum sarih a lo vei hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, chu hmeichhia chu Philistia-ho ram ata a lêt leh ta a; tin, a in leh a lo lal dîl tûrin a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Pathian mi chhiahhlawh Gehazia chu, “Elisan thil ropui a tih zawng zawng mi han hrilh teh khai,” tia a lo biak lai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat thi tawh a tihnun leh thu lal a lo hrilh lai mêk chuan heti hi a ni a, ngai teh, a fapa a tihnunsak leh hmeichhia chuan a in leh a lo lal chu a rawn dîl ve a. Tin, Gehazia chuan, “Aw lalber ka pu, hei hi a ni hmeichhia chu; tin, hei hi a ni a fapa Elisan a tihnun lehsaka chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lalin hmeichhia chu a han zawh chuan a hrilh ta a. Chutichuan, lal chuan hotu pakhat a ruatsak a, “A ta zawng zawng, a lova thil haw zawng zawng chenin, he ram a chhuahsan ata tûn thlenga mi hi pe leh vek rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu Damaska khuaah a kal a; tin, Suria lal Ben-hadada chu a damlo va; tichuan, “Pathian mi hetah a lo kal e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lalin Hazaela hnênah, “Lâwmman keng langin, Pathian mi be tûrin va kal la, ka nâ hi ka ṭha chhuak leh thei ang emaw Lalpa mi lo râwnsak teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hazaela chu amah be tûr chuan a va kal a, lâwmman atân Damaska khuaa thil ṭha tinrêng, sanghâwngsei sawmli phur a keng a, a hmaah chuan a va ding a, “I fapa Ben-hadada, Suria lalin, ‘Ka nâ hi ka ṭha chhuak leh ang em?’ ti tûrin i hnênah hian mi rawn tîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Kal leh ta langin, a hnênah, ‘I ṭha chhuak leh mawlh ang, a ti e,’ ti ang che; amaherawhchu, a la thi ngei dâwn a ni tih zawng Lalpan mi hriattîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, a tân zahthlâk khawpin a melh ta reng mai a; tin, Pathian mi chu a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Hazaela chuan, “Engati nge ka pu chu a ṭah mai?” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Israela thlahte chunga i thil ṭha lo tih tûr ka hriat vâng a ni; an kulhte i la hâlsak ang a, an tlangvâlte khandaihin i la that ang a, an fanau tê tête chu i la paih sawm ang a, nau pai lai an hmeichhiate chu i la pir thlêr dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Hazaela chuan, “Kei i chhiahhlawh, uicho mai mai hian chutiang thil nasa tak chu han ti thei zia em ka nih?” a ti a. Tin, Elisa chuan a chhâng a, “Suria-ho chungah i la lal dâwn tih Lalpan mi hriattîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Elisa hnên ata a chhuak a, a pu hnên lamah chuan a kal ta a; ani chuan, “Elisa chuan eng nge a lo hrilh che?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “ ‘A ṭha chhuak leh mawlh ang,’ tiin mi hrilh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan heti hi a ni a, puan chhah tak a la a, tuiah a hnim a, chu chuan a hmai a upsak a, a thi ta a; tichuan, Hazaela chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jorama kum nga a lal kum chuan (chumi lai chuan Jehosaphata chu Juda lal a ni a), Juda lal Jehosaphata fapa Jehorama chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lal ṭan lai chuan kum sawmthum leh kum hnih mi a ni a; Jerusalem khuaah kum riat ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngte angin, Israel lalte kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a, Ahaba fanu nupuiah a nei a ni; tichuan, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Davida avângin Judai ram chu a tichhe duh lo va, a thlahte chena khâwnvâr neihtîr reng a lo tiam tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama chhanah chuan Edom-ho chu Juda-te lakah an hel a, an chunga lal tûr an insiam chawp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehorama chu Zair khuaah a tawlailîr zawng zawng nên a va kal a; tin, zânah a thawk chhuak a, anmahni hualtu Edom-hote leh an tawlailîr chunga hotute chu a va bei ta a; tin, mite chu an puan in lamahte an tlân ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Edom-ho chu tûn thlengin Juda-te lakah an la hel ta reng a ni. Chumi lai vêk chuan Libna khua pawh an lo hel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Jehorama chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Jehorama chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pi leh pute zîngan Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. A fapa Ahazia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jorama lal kum sâwm leh kum hnih kum chuan, Juda lal Jehorama fapa Ahazia chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahazian ro a rêl ṭan lai chuan kum sawmhnih leh kum hnih mi a ni a; tin, Jerusalem khuaah kum khat ro a rêl a. Tin, a nu hming chu Athali, Israel lal Omria fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngte kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a, Ahaba chhûngte angin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Ahaba chhûngte mâkpa a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ani chu Ahaba fapa Joraman Ramoth-gilead khuaa Suria lal Hazaela a han beihnaah chuan a tel ve a; tin, Suria-ho chuan Jorama chu an lo hliam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Lal Jorama chu Suria lal Hazaela an beihnaa Suria-hovin Rama khuaa an lo hliam chu Jezreel khuaa intidam tûrin a kîr leh ta a. Tin, Juda lal Jehorama fapa Ahazia chu Ahaba fapa Jorama a nat avâng chuan kan tûrin Jezreel khuaah a zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Elisan zâwlneiho fapate zînga pakhat a ko va, a hnênah, “I puan veng la, he hriak bâwm hi keng la, Ramoth-gilead khuaah va kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I va thlen chuan Nimsia fa Jehosaphata fapa Jehua va zawng chhuak langin; va lût la, a unauteho zîng ata ko chhuak la, pindan chhûngrilah luhpui rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, hriak bâwm hi la la, a lûah leih langin, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Israel-te chunga lalah hriak ka thih a che,” tiin,’ ti rawh. Tichuan, kawng hawng la, tlân chhuak rawh, awm rei suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, tlangvâl, zâwlnei tlangvâl chu Ramoth-gilead-ah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a va thlen chuan ngai teh, sipai hotuho an lo ṭhu khâwm a; tin, ani chuan, “Sipai hotu, i hnênah thuchah sawi tûr ka nei e,” a ti a. Tin, Jehua chuan, “A tu bera hnênah hian nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Nangma hnênah hian a ni, sipai hotu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, inah chuan a lût a; tin, a lûah hriak chu a leih a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: ‘ Lalpa mipuiho, Israel-ho chunga lalah hriak ka thih a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite thisen leh Lalpa chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte thisen phuba chu Jezebeli laka ka lâk theihna tûrin i pu Ahaba chhûngte chu i tiboral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngte zawng zawng chu an boral vek ang a; Ahaba aṭang hian mipa fa tawh phawt chu Israel rama mi khuahkhirh leh khirh loh pawh ka tiboral dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba chhûngte chu Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngte leh Ahija fapa Baasa chhûngte angin ka siam ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, uiin Jezebeli chu Jezreel khaw kulh bulah an ei ang a, a phûmtu tûr rêng rêng an awm lo vang,’ tiin,” a ti a. Tichuan, kawng a hawng a, a tlân chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehua chu a pu puipate hnênah chuan a lo chhuak a; pakhat chuan a hnênah, “Ṭha lam thu em ni le? Kha mi âpa kha engtiziaa i hnêna lo kal nge ni le?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “In hriat mi a ni a, a thusawi pawh kha in hria alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hre teh suh e! Min han hrilh teh khai,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Hetiang tak hian min ti alâwm maw le: ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Israel-ho chunga lal atân hriak ka thih a che,” ’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tinin an puan chu an hlîp hmawk hmawk a, kailâwn chungah an phahsak ta ṭheuh va, “Jehua lal a ni ta e,” tiin tawtawrâwt an hâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Nimsia fa Jehosaphata fapa Jehua chuan Jorama chu a phiar ta a (Suria lal Hazaela avângin Jorama leh Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan Ramoth-gilead khua chu an vêng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Jorama erawh chu Suria lal Hazaela nên an inbeihnaa Suria miten an hliam kha Jezreel khuaa intidam tûrin a kîr leh a nih kha). Tin, Jehua chuan, “Ka lama ṭang in nih chuan tu mah rêng rêng Jezreel khuaa hêng thu hi sawi tûrin khua ata hi kal chhuahtîr suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehua chu tawlailîrah a chuang a, Jezreel khuaah a kal a; Jorama chu chutah chuan a mu a ni a. Tin, Juda lal Ahazia pawh Jorama kan tûrin a zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jezreel kulhah râlvêng a ding a, ani chuan Jehua ho lo kal chu a han hmu a, “Mi tam tak ka hmu e,” a ti a. Tin, Jorama chuan, “Sakawr chung chuang mi anmahni hmuak tûrin va tîr la, ‘ṭha lam thu em ni le?’ va ti teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi pakhat sakawr chunga chuang hi a hmuak tûrin a va kal a, “Lalin heti hian a ti: ‘ṭha lam thu em ni le?’ tiin,” a ti a. Tin, Jehua chuan, “Ṭha lam thu chu nanga lo hriat tûr eng nge awm ni? Ka hnungah hian va kal ve rawh,” a ti a. Tin, râlvêng chuan, “Kan mi tirha chuan an hnên chu a va thleng ngei a; nimahsela, a lo kîr leh ta hauh lo mai,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, mi pakhat sakawr chunga chuang hi a tîr leh a, chu mi pawh chuan an hnên a va thleng a, “Lalin heti hian a ti: ‘ṭha lam thu em ni le?’ tiin,” a ti a. Tin, Jehuan a chhâng a, “Ṭha lam thu chu nanga lo hriat tûr eng nge awm ni? Ka hnungah hian va kal ve rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, râlvêng chuan, “Ani pawhin an hnên chu a va thleng ngei a, ani pawh chu a lo kîr leh ta hauh lo mai; tin, a khalh dân pawh Nimsia fapa Jehua khalh dân chiah a ni; mi â ang maiin a khalh ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Jorama chuan, “Buatsaih teh u,” a ti a. Tin, a tawlailîr chu an buatsaih a. Tin, Israel lal Jorama leh Juda lal Ahazia chu mahni tawlailîr ve vein an va chhuak a, Jehua hmuak tûrin an va kal a, Jezreel mi Nabotha huanah an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Joraman Jehua a han hmuh chuan heti hi a ni a, “Ṭha lam thu em ni le, Jehu?” a han ti a. Tin, ani chuan a lo chhâng a, “I nu Jezebeli hian uirê leh dawi a chîn nasat chhûng hian ṭha lam thu eng nge awm thei ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Jorama chuan a kai her a, a tlân a, Ahazia hnênah, “Inbumna a awm a nih hi, Ahazi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chuan a thal ngul chu a theihpatâwpin a kuai a, Jorama dâr leh dâr inkârah a kâp a, thal chu a lungah a lût tlang a, a tawlailîrah a awp ta rawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehuan a sipai hotu Bidkara hnênah, “Pawm la, Jezreel mi Nabotha huan hmunah paih thla rawh; hmâna nang nêna a pa Ahaba hnunga kan chuan dun laia Lalpan he phur hi a chunga a nghah rêng a nih kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan , ‘Niminah Nabotha thisen leh a fapate thisen ka hmu ngei alâwm,’ a tih kha; tin, Lalpan , ‘Hemi hmun ngeiah hian ka thungrûl dâwn che a ni,’ a tih leh kha. Chutichuan, Lalpa thu angin pawm la, hemi hmunah ngei hian paih thla rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda lal Ahazian chu chu a hmuh chuan huan in lamah a tlân ta a. Tin, Jehua chuan a ûm a, “Ani pawh tawlailîrah khân that nghâl rawh u,” a ti a; tichuan, Ibleam khaw kiang, Gur chhohnaah an bei a. Tin, Migiddo khuaah a tlân lût a, chutah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan Jerusalem khuaah tawlailîrin a kalpui a, ama thlânah, a pi leh pute zîngah Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahaba fapa Jorama kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal kumin Ahazia chu Juda-ho chungah a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chu Jezreel khuaa a va luh chuan, Jezebelin a lo hria a; tichuan, a mitte a lo hnawih a, a sam te a lo chei a, tukverhah a dâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Jehua kulh kawngkaa a lo luh lai takin, “Ṭha lam thu em ni le, nang, mahni pute thattu, Zimri pa?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ani chu tukverh lam hawi chuan a han dâk chho va, “Tu nge ka lama ṭang che u? Tute nge?” a ti a. Mi tilreh pahnih emaw, pathum emaw hi a lam hawiin an lo dâk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Han theh thla rawh u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, an theh thla a, a thi chuan bang leh sakawrte chu a per nguai mai a; tin, ani chuan a lo chîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a lût a, a eiin a in a. “Anchhe dawngnu kha va ngaihven ta ula, va phûm rawh u, lal fanu a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, phûm tûrin an va kal a; nimahsela, a lu ruh te, a kebâwr te, a kutphahbâwr te ngawt lo chu an va hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, an lo kal leh a, an rawn hrilh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Hei hi Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Tisbe mi Elija hmanga, ‘Jezreel kulh bulah uiin Jezebeli chu an la ei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jezebeli ruang chu Jezreel khaw kulh bula huana êk dûr ang mai a la ni ang a; tichuan, “Hei chu Jezebeli a ni â!” an tih loh nân,’ tih thu a sawi kha a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaban Samari-ah chuan fapa sawmsarih a nei a. Tin, Jehua chuan Samari-ah, Jezreel khaw hotu, upate hnênah leh Ahaba fate lo enkawl tleitute hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“He lehkha hi in hmuh veleh, in pu fate chu in hnênah an awm a ni a; tin, tawlailîrte, sakawrte, kulhpui nei khuate pawh, râlthuamna nên in nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chutichuan, in pu fate zînga mi a ṭha ber leh a fel ber zawng chhuak ula, a pa lalṭhutthlêngah ṭhuttîr ula, in pu chhûngte do chu dopui rawh u,” tia ziak lehkha a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan an hlau ta êm êm mai a, “Ngai teh u, lal pahnih pawh khân an chelh tawh lo a ni a, keinin engtin nge kan chelh tehlul ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal in chhûnga hotu ber te, khawpui awptu te, upaho te, naupangho lo enkawl tleitute nên chuan Jehua hnênah, “I chhiahhlawhte kan ni e, ti tûra min hrilh apiang chu kan ti zêl ang; tu mah lalah kan siam lo vang; nangin ṭha i tih ang angin ti ang che,” tiin mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Ka lama ṭang in niha, ka thu in âwih dâwn chuan in pu fapate lû han la ula, naktûk hetih hun hma hian Jezreel khuaah ka hnênah lo kal ang che u,” tiin lehkha a thawn leh a. Lal fapate chu sawmsarih an ni a, khawpui mi lianho, anmahni enkawl tleitute hnênah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, lehkha chu an han hmuh chuan heti hi a ni a, lal fapate chu an man a, a sawmsarih chuan an that a, an lû chu bâwmrângah an dah a, Jezreel khuaah a hnênah an thawn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, zualko a lo thleng a, “Lal fapate lû chu an rawn la ta e,” tiin a hrilh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Kulh luhna kawngka bulah hmun hnihah tiang khâwm ula, naktûk thlengin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan heti hi a ni a, a va chhuak a, a ding a, mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Mi fel in ni e; ngai teh u, ka pu chu ka phiar a, ka lo tihlum ta tak a; a nih leh, hêngho zawng zawng hi tu thah nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan Ahaba chhûngte chungchâng thu a sawi, ‘ Lalpa thu chu leilungah hian a luang ral hlek lo vang tih hre rawh u,’ tia Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Elija hmanga a sawi kha a rawn hlen ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehua chuan Jezreel khuaa Ahaba chhûngte la awm zawng zawng leh, a mi lian zawng zawng leh a ṭhian zawng zawng leh, a puithiamte chu pakhat mah zuahsak hlek lovin a that fai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, a chhuak a, Samari-ah a kal ta a. Tin, kalkawnga berâmpute berâm hmul mehna in a va thlenin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehua chuan Juda lal Ahazia unauteho a hmu a, “Tute nge in nih?” a ti a. Tin anni chuan, “Ahazia unaute kan ni a, lal fateho leh lalnu fateho chibai kan zuk bûk dâwn a ni,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “A nungin man rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, a nungin an man a, berâm hmul mehna in khur bulah chuan an that a, mi sawmli leh pahnih zet an ni a; pakhat mah a zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta a chhuah hnu chuan Rekaba fapa Jehonadaba, amah hmuak tûra lo kal a va hmu a; tichuan, chibai a bûk a, a hnênah, “I chunga rilru dik ka pu ang hian, rilru dik i pu ve emaw chu?” a ti a. Jehonadaba chuan, “Pu e,” tiin a chhâng a. “A nih leh i kut mi han pe teh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a kut chu a han pe a; tin, ani chuan a hnênah a tawlailîr chhûngah a kai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka hnênah lo kal ve la, Lalpa tâna ṭhahnem ka ngaihzia hi han hmu ve teh rêng khai,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a tawlailîrah a chuantîr ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Samari a va thlen chuan, Ahaba chhûngte Samari-a la awm chhunate chu a tihboral zawh vek hma loh chuan a that zêl a, Elija hnêna a sawi Lalpa thu ang ngei khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chuan mipuiho zawng zawng chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah chuan, “Ahaba khân Baala rawng hi a bâwl hlek chauh a ni a, Jehua erawh hi chuan nasa takin a nia a bâwl dâwn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Baala zâwlneiho zawng zawngte, a betu zawng zawngte leh a puithiam zawng zawngte ka hnênah hian han ko khâwm teh u. Tu mah kim lo suh se; Baala hnênah hian inthawina ropui tak hlan tûr ka nei a; tu pawh a kim lo apiang chu a nung hlek lo vang,” a ti a. Nimahsela, Jehua chuan Baala betute chu tihhlum tumin, fin vervêkin a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chuan, “Baala hmingin kûtpui siam rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, chu chu an than vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chuan Israel ram zawng zawngah a thawn vêl a; tichuan, Baala betute zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, tel lo rêng rêng an awm lo. Tin, Baala inah chuan an lût a; tin, Baala in chu kawngka aṭanga kawmchâr thlengin an khat hmur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, inthuamna puan enkawltu hnênah, “Baala betu zawng zawngte hi inthuamna puan han lâksak rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, inthuamna puante chu a rawn lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Jehua chu, Rekaba fapa Jehonadaba nên Baala inah chuan an lût a; tin, Baala betute hnênah chuan, “Hetah hian Baala betute chauh lo, Lalpa mite hi an lo awm ve dah ang e, zawng ula, en vêl teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, inthawinate leh hâlral thilhlan hlân tûrin an lût ta a. Jehua chuan pâwnah mi sawmriat a lo dintîr tawh rêng a, “Hêng in kuta ka pêk che u hi tu pawh an chhuah vaih chuan, a chhuahtu chuan a nun aiah ama nunna chu a chân ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hâlral thilhlan a hlan zawh veleh heti hi a ni a, Jehua chuan vêngtu sipai leh an hotute hnênah, “Va lût ula, va that rawh u; tu mah chhuahtîr suh u,” a ti a. Tin, khandaihin an sât chiam a; tin, vêngtu sipai leh an hotute chuan an paih chhuak a; tin, Baala in chhûngrilah chuan an lût zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Baala ina milemte chu an la chhuak a, an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Baala lungphun chu an tichim a, Baala in chu an tichhia a, dailênna inah an hmang ta a, tûn thleng hian an la hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Jehua chuan Israel ram ata Baala chu a tiboral a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualna - Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tihte chu Jehua chuan a bân chuang lo, chu chu Bethel khua leh Dan khuaa rangkachak bâwngno lemte biak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Jehua hnênah, “Ka mittlung taka thil i tih avâng leh ka rilru duhthusâm ang taka Ahaba chhûngte chunga i tih avângin, i fapate chu chhuan lina thlengin Israel-te lalṭhutthlêngah an ṭhu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehua chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian dân chu a thinlung zawng zawngin a pawm lo va; Jeroboaman Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih sual kha a bân chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Lalpan Israel-te ram chu a tihzîmsak ṭan ta a; tichuan, Hazaelan Israel ram zawng zawngah chuan a hneh zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan aṭanga khawchhak lam Gilead ram zawng zawng - Gad-hote, Reuben-hote, Manase-hote - Arnon ruama Aroer aṭanga Gilead leh Basan ram thleng rakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehua chanchin dangte, a thiltih zawng zawngte, a thiltihtheihzia zawng zawngte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehua chu a pi leh pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, Samaria khuaah an phûm ta a. Tin, a fapa Jehoahaza chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Samari rama Israel-te chunga Jehua rorêl chhûng chu kum sawmhnih leh kum riat a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahazia nu Athalin a fapa a thi tih a lo hriat chuan, a tho va, lal fate zawng zawng chu a that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahazia fapa Joasa erawh chu Lal Jorama fanu, Ahazia farnu Jehosebi chuan lal fapa an thahte zîng ata chu a hruai bo va, a enkawltu nên khum pindanah a awmtîr a, Athali hmuh theih loh tûrin an thukru a; tichuan, thah a ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chu amah nên chuan Lalpa inah kum ruk an biru a; tichuan, Athali chuan chu ramah chuan ro a rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a kum sarihnaah chuan Jehoiadan Kereth mite leh vêngtu sipaite zînga mi sipai za hotute chu a kohtîr a, Lalpa inah a hnênah a hruai luhtîr a; tin, an hnênah thu a thlung a, Lalpa inah chuan chhia a chhamtîr a, lal fapa chu a entîr hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “In tih tûr chu hetiang hi a ni: in zînga Chawlhnia lo kal tûrte hi hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khatin lal in chu in vêng ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu Sur kulh kawngkaah in awm ang a, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu vêngtute hnung lama kulh kawngkaah in awm ang; chutiang chuan in chu in vêng ang a, a dangtuah in awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zînga pawl hnih, Chawlhnia ṭîn tûr zawng zawng chuan lal kiang velah Lalpa in chu in vêng ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mi tinin hriamhrei kengin lal chu in hual vêl ang a; tu pawh hual chhûnga lo lût apiang chu lo thah zêl tûr a ni. Lal chu a lût leh a chhuak chu zui zêl rawh u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotute chuan puithiam Jehoiada thupêk ang zawng zawng chuan an ti a; tin, mahni hote ṭheuh Chawlhnia lo kal tûrte leh, Chawlhnia ṭîn tûrte chu an hruai a, puithiam Jehoiada hnênah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan sipai za hotute chu Lalpa ina awm, Lal Davida fei leh phawte chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu sipaite chuan hriamhrei keng ṭheuhvin, in ding lampang aṭanga vei lampang thlengin, maichâm leh in hrûlah chuan lal chu an din hual mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, lal fapa chu a rawn hruai chhuak a, lallukhum a khumtîr a, hriattîrna thu chu a pe a; tin, lalah an siam a, hriak an thih a; tin, an kut an bêng a, “Pathianin lalber humhim rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu sipaite leh mipuihote thâwm chu Athalin a lo hriat chuan, Lalpa inah mipuite zîngah chuan a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a han en a, ngai teh, lal chu dân angin ban hrûlah a lo ding a, sipai hotute leh tawtawrâwt tumtute chu lal bulah an ding a. Tin, chumi rama mi zawng zawng chu an hlim êm êm a, tawtawrâwt an hâm chiam a. Tichuan, Athali chuan a puante a pawt thlêr a, “Phiarrûkna! Phiarrûkna a ni ta le!” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Jehoiada chuan sipaite chunga hotua ruat sipai za hotute chu thu a pe a, an hnênah, “Sipaihote kârah chhuahtîr rawh u; tu pawh a zui apiang chu khandaiha sah hlum tûr a ni,” a ti a; puithiam chuan, “ Lalpa inah zawng thah tûr a ni lo ve,” a lo ti tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, kawng an kian a; tin, sakawr luhna kawngah lal inah a kal a; chutah chuan a ni, an thah tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada chuan Lalpa leh lal leh mipuite kârah chuan Lalpa mite an lo nihna tûr thu a thlung ta a; lal leh mipuite kârah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi rama mi zawng zawng chu Baala inah an kal a, an tichim a; a maichâmte leh a lemte chu an tisawm dep a, Baala puithiam Mattana pawh maichâm bulah an that a. Tin, puithiam chuan Lalpa in vêngtu hotute a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotute, Kereth mite, vêngtu sipaite leh, chumi rama mi zawng zawng chu a hruai a, Lalpa in ata lal chu an han hruai thla a, vêngtute kawngkaa lûtin lal inah an kal a. Tichuan, lalhote lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi rama mi zawng zawng chu an lâwm a; tin, khawpui chu buai lovin a awm ta a; tin, Athali chu khandaihin lal inah an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehoasa chu ro a rêl ṭan lai chuan kum sarih mi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehua kum sarih a lal kum chuan Jehoasa chu a lal ṭan a; Jerusalem khuaah kum sawmli a lal a; a nu hming chu Zibi, Beer-seba khuaa mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Jehoiadan Jehoasa chu a zirtîr chhûng zawng Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmun sângte zawng thehthang bo a ni chuang lo; hmun sângahte chuan mite chu an la inthawiin rimtui an la hâl reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jehoasan puithiamte hnênah, “ Lalpa ina lâk luh thil serh tlanna sum zawng zawng, chhiar tawhte zînga kal apiangte tâna tuk, an nun tlanna sum te, tu pawhin Lalpa ina lâk luh an phal sum zawng zawngte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />puithiamten an hmêlhriatte hnên aṭangin lo la ṭheuh sela; tichuan, in chhia, a chhe lai apiang siam rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hi a ni a, Lal Jehoasa chu kum sawmhnih leh kum thum a lal hnu pawhin puithiamte chuan in chhia chu an la siam lo fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Jehoasa chuan puithiam Jehoiada leh puithiam dangte chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Engati nge in chhe laite hi in siam loh? Tûnah zawng in hmêlhriatte hnên ata tangka chu la tawh suh ula, in chhe siam nân pe chhuak tawh zâwk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chuan mite hnên ata tangka lâk tawh loh leh, in chhe laite siamtu nih loh chu an remti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, puithiam Jehoiadan bâwm a la a, a chhîn a rek pawp a, Lalpa ina luha ding lampang, maichâm bulah a hûng a; chutah chuan Lalpa ina tangka lâk luh zawng zawng chu kawngkhâr vêngtu puithiamte chuan an la dah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, bâwmah chuan tangka a tam ta hle tih an hriatin, lal lehkhaziaktu leh puithiam lalber chu an han kal a, an fûn a, Lalpa ina tangka awm chin chu an chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an tangka chhiar chu hnathawkho, Lalpa in satute chunga hotute an pe a, anni chuan Lalpa in beitu, themthiamte leh in satute hlawhah te, lung chhertute leh lung lai chhuaktute hlawhah te, Lalpa in chhe laite siamna tûr thing leh lung chherah te leh in siam nâna mamawh apiangahte an hmang ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa in chhûnga an tangka rawn lâk chuan Lalpa in atân tangkaraw note, khâwnvâr puan chehnate, maihûnte, tawtawrâwtte, rangkachak bungbêlte, tangkaraw bungbêlte an siam lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hnathawktute an pe ṭhîn a, anni chuan Lalpa in siam nan an hmang zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hnathawktute pêk atâna tangka an vawntîrate pawh kha an en zuipui chuang lêm lo; anni chuan rinawm takin an ti si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawhchhiat thawina thilhlan tangka leh, sual thawina thilhlan tangkate chu Lalpa inah chuan an la lût lo; puithiamte pual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Suria lal Hazaela chuan Gath khua a han bei a, a han la a; tin, Hazaela chu Jerusalem-a kal zêl a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehoasa chuan Juda lal a puteho Jehosaphata te, Jehorama te, Ahazia te lo hlan tawh thil serh zawng zawng leh, ama thil serhte leh, Lalpa ina mi leh lal ina ro dah khâwmnaa mi rangkachak awm zawng zawng chu a la vek a, Suria lal Hazaela a thawn a; tichuan, Jerusalem chu a hawisan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehoasa chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a mite chu an tho va, an phiarru a, Jehoasa chu Silla pan chhukna kawnga Milo inah an bei a, an tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama mi Simeathi fapa Jozakara leh Somera fapa Jehozabada-ten an that a ni; tichuan, a pi leh pute zîngah Davida khawpuian an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Amazia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Ahazia fapa Jehoasa kum sawmhnih leh kum thum a lal kum chuan, Jehua fapa Jehoahaza chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan a lal ṭan a, kum sâwm leh kum sarih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a, Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnate kha a chîng ve a, a kalsan leh ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Israel-te chungah chuan a thinrim ta êm êm a; tichuan, Suria lal Hazaela kutah leh Hazaela fapa Ben-hadada kutah chuan a pe ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jehoahaza chuan Lalpa hnênah a ngên chiam a; tin, Lalpan a thu chu a lo ngaihthlâksak a; Israel-te hnehchhiaha an awma, Suria lalin anmahni a hnehchhiahzia chu a hmu reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Israel-hote chu chhandamtu a pe a; chutichuan, Suria-hote hnuaia an awm chu an chhuak a, Israela thlahte chu tûn hma ang bawk khân anmahni in lamah an awm leh ta hle hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Amaherawhchu, Israel-te thil tihsualtîra a tih Jeroboama chhûngteho sualnate kha an kalsan lo va, an la chîng ta reng zâwk a; tin, Samari khuaah chuan Aseri pawh chu a la awm reng nghe nghe a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaza chu a mite zînga sakawr chung chuang mi sawmnga leh, tawlailîr sâwm leh, sipai sîngkhat tih loh chu neih a phalsak si lo va; Suria lal chuan a tiboral vek a, vaivut chîl dip ang maiin a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehoahaza chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, a thiltihtheihziate chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jehoahaza chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl ta a; tin, Samari khuaah an phûm a. Tin, a fapa Joasa chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda lal Joasa kum sawmthum leh kum sarih a lal kum chuan Jehoahaza fapa Jehoasa chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan a lal ṭan a, kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîra a tih Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualna zawng zawngte kha a kalsan lo va, a la chîng ta reng zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Joasa chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, Juda lal Amazia a beih laia a thiltihtheihziate chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Joasa chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl ta a; tin, Jeroboama chu a lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu a; tin, Joasa chu Samari khuaah Israel lalte zîngah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu a thihpuina tûr natnain a lo na tawh a; tichuan, Israel lal Joasa chu a hnênah a zuk kal a, a ṭah a, “Ka pa, ka pa, Israel-te tawlailîr leh sakawr chung chuang mite hentu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Thal ngul leh thalte han la teh,” a ti a; tin, thal ngul leh thalte a han la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te lal hnênah chuan, “Thal ngul kha han chelh teh,” a ti a; tichuan, a han chelh a. Tin, Elisa chuan lal kut chungah a kut a nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chhak lam tukverh han hawng teh,” a ti a; tin, a han hawng a. Tin, Elisa chuan, “Kâp rawh,” a ti a; tin, a han kâp a. Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa hnehna thal, Suria-ho hnehna thal a nih kha; Aphek khuaah chuan Suria-hote chu boral dêr khawpin i hneh dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, “Thalte kha han la teh,” a ti leh a; tichuan, a han la a. Tin, Israel lal hnênah chuan, “Lei kha han chhun teh,” a ti a; tichuan, vawi thum a chhun a, a bâng ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian mi chu a chungah a thinrim ta a, “Vawi nga vawi ruk lai i chhun tûr asin ni le; tichuan, Suria-hote chu boral dêr khawpin i hneh tûr a ni a. Amaherawhchu, Suria-ho chu vawi thum chauh i hneh dâwn a nih tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Elisa chu a thi a, an phûm ta a. Tin, kum a lo vei hian Moab-ho pâwlte chuan an ram chu an rawn rûn ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat an phûm dâwn lai takin heti hi a ni a, ngai teh, hmêlma pâwl pakhat an han hmu a; tichuan, chu mi chu Elisa thlânah chuan an thlâk ta mai a; tin, a ruang chuan Elisa ruhte chu a zuk deh veleh a lo nung leh a, a ding ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal Hazaela chuan Jehoahaza chhanah chuan Israel-te chu a hnehchhiah reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan Abrahama hnênah te, Isaaka hnênah te, Jakoba hnênah te thu a thlun avângin anmahni chu a khawngaih a, a lainat a, a ngaihsak a, anmahni chu a tiboral duh lo va, a hnên ata a la paih thla duh lo cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal Hazaela chu a thi a; a fapa Benhadada chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Jehoahaza fapa Jehoasa chuan Hazaela fapa Benhadadan a pa Jehoahaza a rûna, khua a lâksakte kha a chhuhsak leh a. Joasa chuan vawi thum a hneh a, Israel ram khuate chu a la leh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel lal Joahaza fapa Joasa kum hnih a lal kum chuan Juda lal Joasa fapa Amazia a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal ṭan tirh chuan kum sawmhnih leh kum nga mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh kum kua a lal a; a nu hming chu Jehoadini, Jerusalem mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil fel tak a ti ṭhîn a, a pu Davida erawh chu a tluk lo; a pa Joasa thiltih ang apiang a ti ve ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmun sângte zawng thehthang bo a ni chuang lo; hmun sângahte chuan mite chu an la inthawiin, rimtui an la hâl reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a ram chu a han din ngheh veleh heti hi a ni a, a mite, a pa, lal thattute chu a that ve thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chûng tualthattu fate chu a that lo; Mosia dân bua, “Fate avângin pate tihhlum tûr a ni lo va, pate avângin fate tihhlum tûr a ni hek lo, mi tin mahni sual avângin an thi tûr a ni,” tia Lalpa thupêk dân ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom-ho chu Chi Ruamah sîngkhat a that a, Sela khua a bei a, a la a, a hmingah chuan Joktheel a ti a, tûn thlengin an la ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Amazian Israel lal Jehua fapa Jehoahaza fa Jehoasa hnênah, “Hawh teh, hmai chhanah i lo inen teh ang,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Jehoasa chuan Juda lal Amazia hnênah, “Lebanon tlânga hlîngin Lebanon tlânga sidar hnênah, ‘I fanu kha ka fapa nupuiah neihtîr teh khai,’ tiin a chah a; tin, Lebanon tlânga ramsa a lo kal a, hling chu a rawn chîl thlu ta dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang hian Edom-ho chu i hneh ngei tak a, i rilru a lo chapo ta a nih hi. I chapo kha tawmpui hle hle mai rawh; nang leh Juda ram chawp chawpa chhiatna, i tâna ṭha lo tûr thil enga tân nge i cho chhuah dâwn ni?” tiin mi a tîr ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amazia chuan a lo ngaithla duh lo va. Chutichuan, Israel lal Jehoasa chu a han chho va; Juda lal Amazia nên chuan Juda ram Beth-semes khuaah hmai chhanah an inen ta ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Juda chu Israel-te lakah a lo tlâwm ta a; mi tin mahni in lamah an tlân haw ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Jehoasa chuan Juda lal Ahazia fapa Jehoasa fa Amazia chu Beth-semes-ah chuan a man a, Jerusalem khuaah a kal a, Jerusalem kulh chu Ephraim kulh kawngka aṭanga kulh kil kawngka thlengin tawng zali zet a tichim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina mi leh lal ina ro dah khâwmnaa mi, rangkachak leh tangkarua leh bungbêl zawng zawng, a awm apiang a la a, hrênga tâng tûrte nên; tin, Samari khaw lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehoasa thiltih chanchin dang te, a thiltihtheihzia te, Juda lal Amazia a beih thute chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Jehoasa chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, Samari khuaan Israel lalte zîngah an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Jeroboama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda lal Joasa fapa Amazia chu Israel-te lal Jehoahaza fapa Jehoasa thih hnuin kum sâwm leh kum nga a la dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Amazia chanchin dangte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaah amah an phiarru a; tichuan, Lakis khuaah a tlân a; nimahsela, Lakis khuaah chuan mi an ûmtîr a, chutah chuan an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a ruang chu sakawrin an kalpui a, a pi leh pute zîngan Davida khawpui Jerusalem-ah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Juda mi zawng zawngten kum sâwm leh kum ruk mi, Azaria an hruai a, a pa Amazia aiah lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan Elath khua chu a siam ṭha leh a, Juda ramah a telh leh a, chumi hnuah chuan lal chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda lal Joasa fapa Amazia kum sâwm leh kum nga a lal kum chuan Israel lal Joasa fapa Jeroboama chu Samari khuaah a lal ṭan a, kum sawmli leh kum khat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîrtu Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualna zawng zawng kha kalsan rêng a nei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin a chhiahhlawh, Gath-hepher mi Amittaia fapa zâwlnei Jona hmanga thu a sawi ang khân, Hamath luhna aṭanga Araba tuifinriat thlengin Israel ramah a telh leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan Israel-te hrehawmzia chu a nasa êm êm mai tih a hre si a; khuahkhirh leh khirh lohte pawh an awm si lo va, Israel-te ṭanpuitu tûr tu mah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpan Israel-te hming hi vân hnuaiah hian a tichimit hlauh dâwn tih zawng a sawi lo rêng a; Joasa fapa Jeroboama hmangin a chhandam ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeroboama chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, a thiltihtheihzia te, a râl beih thûte, tûn hmaa Juda ram chan ni ṭhîn Damaska leh Hamath khua Israel-te tân a lo lâksak leh tâk thute chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama chu a pi leh pu, Israel lalte hnênah chuan a muhîl ve a. Tichuan, a fapa Zekaria chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama kum sawmhnih leh kum sarih a lal kum chuan Juda lal Amazia fapa Azaria a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal ṭan tirh chuan kum sâwm leh kum ruk mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh kum hnih a lal a; a nu hming chu Jekoli, Jerusalem mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a pa Amazia thiltih ang apiang ti vein, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmun sângte zawng thehthang bo a ni chuang lo; hmun sângahte chuan mite chu an la inthawiin, rimtui an la hâl reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan lal chu a rawn hrem ta a; chutichuan, a thih ni thlengin a lo phâr a, in hrangah a awm ta a. Tin, lal fapa Jothama chu an rama mite rorêlsakin in chhûng lam hotuah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Azaria chanchin dang, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Azaria chu a pi leh pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a; tin, a pi leh pute zîngan Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Jothama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda lal Azaria kum sawmthum leh kum riat a lal kum chuan Jeroboama fapa Zekaria chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan thla ruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a pute tih ang bawk Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîrtu Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnate kha a kalsan lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jabesa fapa Saluman amah a phiarru a, mipuite hmaah a bei a, a that a, a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Zekaria chanchin dangte chu ngai teh, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpan Jehua hnêna, “I fapate chu chhuan lina thlengin Israel-te lalṭhutthlêngah an ṭhu ang,” tih thu a sawi kha a ni. Tichuan, chutiang tak chu a lo ni ta ngei rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda lal Uzzia kum sawmthum leh kum kua a lal kum chuan Jabesa fapa Saluma chu a lal ṭan a; Samari khuaah thla khat chhûng a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Gadia fapa Menahema chu Tirza khua aṭangin a han chho va, Samari khuaah a kal a, Jabesa fapa Saluma chu Samari khuaah chuan a bei a, a that a, a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Saluma chanchin dang te, a phiarrûkna thute chu ngai teh, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Menaheman Tirza aṭang chuan Tipsa khua leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng leh a ramte chu a bei a; an inhawn loh avângin a bei a ni; chûnga nau pai lai hmeichhia zawng zawng chu a pir thlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda lal Azaria kum sawmthum leh kum kua a lal kum chuan, Gadia fapa Menahema chu Israel-te chungah a lal ṭan a, Samari khuaah kum sâwm a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîrtu Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnate kha a dam chhûngin a kalsan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Assuria lal Pulan an ram chu a rawn bei a; ram chu a neih nghehpui theih nân Menahema chuan Pula chu tangkarua talent sâng a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Menahema chuan Assuria lal pêk atân Israel mi neinungho zawng zawng lakah chuan tangkarua sekel sawmnga ṭheuh a khawn a. Chutichuan, Assuria lal chu a haw leh a, chu ramah chuan a awm reng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Menahema chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Menahema chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a. Tichuan, a fapa Pekahia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda lal Azaria kum sawmnga a lal kum chuan Menahema fapa Pekahia chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan a lal ṭan a, kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîra a tih Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnate kha a kalsan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a sipai hotu Remalia fapa Pekan amah chu a phiarru a, Samari khuaa lal ina kulhah Argoba nên, Ariea nên a that ta a; a hnênah chuan Gilead mi sawmnga an awm ve a. Tichuan, Pekahia chu a that a, a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Pekahia chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu ngai teh, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda lal Azaria kum sawmnga leh kum hnih a lal kum chuan, Remalia fapa Peka chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan a lal ṭan a, kum sawmhnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; Israel-te thil tihsualtîrtu Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualnate kha a kalsan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel lal Peka lal laiin Assuria lal Tiglath-pileseran Ijon khua te, Abel-beth-maaka khua te, Janoa khua te, Kedes khua te, Hazor khua te, Gilead leh Galili ram te, Naphtali ram zawng zawng chu a la a; tin, Assuria raman salah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Ela fapa Hosean Remalia fapa Peka chu a phiarru a, a bei a, a that a, Uzzia fapa Jothama kum sawmhnih a lal kum chuan a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, Peka chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu ngai teh, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel lal Remalia fapa Peka kum hnih a lal kum chuan Juda lal Uzzia fapa Jothama chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lal ṭan tirh chuan kum sawmhnih leh kum nga mi a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a; a nu hming chu Jerusi, Zadoka fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a pa Uzzia thiltih ang apiang ti vein Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmun sângte zawng thehthang bo a ni chuang lo; hmun sângahte chuan mite chu an la inthawiin, rimtui an hâl reng ṭhîn. Lalpa in kawngka chhakta zâwk chu a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, Jothama chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Suria lal Rezina leh, Remalia fapa Peka chu Juda-ho bei tûrin Lalpan a tîr ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Jothama chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pi leh pute zîngan a pu Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Ahaza chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remalia fapa Peka kum sâwm leh kum sarih a lal kum chuan Juda lal Jothama fapa Ahaza chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaza chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih mi a ni; tin, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a. A pu Davida angin Lalpa a Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha tak a ti ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel lalte kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a, a ni, Lalpan Israela thlahte hmaa a hnawh chhuah tâk hnamten thil tenawm tak an tih ṭhin angin a fapa meiah a luhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hmun sângah te, tlângah te, thing hring tin hnuaiahte a inthawi a, rimtui a hâl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Suria lal Rezina leh Israel lal Remalia fapa Peka chu Jerusalem bei tûrin an han chho va, Ahaza chu an han hual a; nimahsela, an hneh thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Suria lal Rezina chuan Elath khua chu Suria ram atân a la leh a, Juda-te chu Elath khua ata a hnawt chhuak a; tin, Suria-ho chuan Elath khua chu an va luah a, tûn thlengin an la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahaza chuan Assuria lal Tiglath-pilesera hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh leh i fapa ka ni alâwm. Mi bei tûra lo thawk Suria lal kut ata leh Israel lal kut ata hi mi han chhan chhuak teh khai,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Ahaza chuan Lalpa ina tangkarua leh rangkachak awm apiang, lal ina ro dah khâwmnaa mi nên a la a, Assuria lal hnênah lâwmmanah a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal chuan a thusawi chu a lo pawm a; tichuan, Assuria lal chuan Damaska khua chu a han bei a, a la a, a mite chu Kir raman salah a hruai a, Rezina chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lal Ahaza chu Assuria lal Tiglath-pilesera be tûrin Damaska khuaah a kal a, Damaska khuaa maichâm chu a va hmu a; tichuan, Lal Ahaza chuan chu maichâm lem leh an siam dân ang chiaha entawn tûr puithiam Urija hnênah a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Urija chuan maichâm a han siam a; Lal Ahazan Damaska khua aṭanga a thawn ang chiah chuan puithiam Urija chuan Damaska khua aṭanga Lal Ahaza lo haw leh hmain a lo siam hman diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Damaska khua ata lal a lo thlenin lal chuan maichâm chu a han hmu a; tin, lal chuan maichâm chu a pan hnai a, a han lâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, maichâmah chuan a hâlral thilhlan te hâlin a chhangphut thilhlan te a hlân a, a in tûr thilhlan a leih a, a remna thilhlan te thisen chu a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin Lalpa hmaa dâr maichâm, a maichâm leh Lalpa in inkâra mi, in hma zâwn ata chu a la sawn a, a maichâm hmâr lampangah chuan a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lal Ahaza chuan, “Maichâm lian puiah hian zîng hâlral thilhlan te, tlai lam chhangphut thilhlan te, lal hâlral thilhlan te, a chhangphut thilhlan te, kan rama mipui zawng zawng hâlral thilhlan te, an chhangphut thilhlan te, an in tûr thilhlante nên hian hâlin hlân la; tin, a chungah chuan hâlral thilhlan thisen zawng zawng leh inthawina thisen zawng zawng chu theh ang che. Dâr maichâm erawh chu ka biakna tûr a ni ang,” tiin puithiam Urija chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam Urija chuan Lal Ahaza thupêk ang zawng zawng chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lal Ahaza chuan hûnchhan khuarte chu a tichhia a, insilna bêl chu a dah sawn a; a hûnna dâr sebâwngpa ata te tuizêm chu a la thla a, lungrem chungah a hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni atâna chung nei kawng ina an siam leh pâwn lama lal luhna chu Assuria lal avângin Lalpa inah a thlâkthleng ta hlauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Ahaza thiltih chanchin dangte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ahaza chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pi leh pute zîngan Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Hezekia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Ahaza kum sâwm leh kum hnih a lal kum chuan Ela fapa Hosea chu Israel-te chungah Samari khuaan a lal ṭan a, kum kua a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a; amaherawhchu, a hmaa Israel lalte ang êm zawngin a ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assuria lal Salmaneseran a han rûn a; tichuan, Hosea chu a chhiah khuaah a awm ta a, chhiah te a pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal chuan Hosean a phiar rûk thu a lo hria a, Aigupta lal Soa hnênah mi a tîr bawk a, kum tina a pêk ṭhin ang khân Assuria lal chu chhiah a pe ta bawk si lo va; chuvângin, Assuria lal chuan tân inah phuar chungin a khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Assuria lal chuan ram zawng zawng chu a hrût chhuak vek a, Samari khuaah a han chho va, kum thum a hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hosea kum kua a lal kum chuan Assuria lal chuan Samari khua chu a la a, Israel-hote chu Assuria ramah a hruai a, Hala ramah te, Gozan rama Habor luiah te, Media-ho khuaahte a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutianga an lo awmna chhan chu Israela thlahte chuan Aigupta lal Pharaoa kut ata, Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu Lalpa an Pathian chunga thil an tihsuala, pathian dangte an pawisak zâwka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan Israela thlahte hmaa a lo hnawh chhuah tâk hnamte thuruat leh Israel lalte pawm thuruatte anga an awm vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa an Pathian chungah chuan thil ṭha lo tak a rûkin an ti ṭhîn a, an khua zawng zawngah râlvêngtute in sâng aṭanga kulh nei khaw thlengin hmun sâng te an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlâng sâng tinah leh thing hring tin hnuaiah hian lungphunte phunin, Aseri-te an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng hmun sâng zawng zawngah chuan Lalpan an hmaa a ûm bo tâk hnamte tih dân ang khân rimtuite an hâl ṭhîn a; Lalpa tihthinrim nân thil sual tak an ti bawk ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpan an hnêna, “Hetiang hi ti suh u,” a tih milemte rawng an bâwl bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Dân zawm tûr, in pi leh pute ka pêk leh ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmanga ka hriattîr che u ang zêl chuan, in awm dân sual hi hawisan ula, ka thupêkte leh ka thuruatte chu pawm rawh u,” tiin, Israel-te leh Juda-te chu zâwlnei tin leh hmutheitu tin hmangin a hriattîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin an pawm duh lo va, an pi leh pu, Lalpa an Pathian ring duh lotute an intiluhlul angin an intiluhlul ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a thuruat te, an pi leh pute hnêna a thuthlun te, an hnêna a thuhriattîrte chu an pawisa duh lo va; thil lawi lo mai mai an pawm a, eng mah lo mai an lo ni ta a; an chungchâng thûa Lalpan , “Ammahni ang chuan ti suh u,” a lo tih tawh, an kiang vêla hnamte tih dân an la ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa an Pathian thupêk zawng zawng chu an hawisan a, bâwngno lem chhûn pahnih an siam a; tin, Aseri an siam a, vâna awm zawng zawng khi an bia a, Baala rawng an bâwl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an fapate leh an fanute chu meiah an luhtîr a, aien te leh dawi te an chîng a, Lalpa tihthinrim nâna a mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak ti tûrin an inhralh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpa chu Israel-te chungah a thinrim ta êm êm a, a mit hmuh phâk lohvah a suan bo ta daih a; Juda hnam chauh lo chu awm an awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda-te pawh chuan Lalpa an Pathian thupêkte chu an zâwm lo va, Israel-te pawm thuruatte angin an awm zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israela thlahte rêng rêng chu a duh ta lo va, anmahni chu a tirethei a, a mit hmuh phâk loh va a suan bo daih hma loh chuan rawktute kutah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te chu Davida chhûngte an nihna a paihsak ta si a; tichuan, Nebata fapa Jeroboama kha lalah an siam a; tin, Jeroboama chuan Israel-ten Lalpa an zui chu a lo kuai pêng a, thil sual nasa tak a tihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Jeroboama thil tihsual ang zawng zawng chu an ti ve a; chûngte chu Lalpan a zâwlneite zawng zawng hmanga a lo sawi tawh anga a mit hmuh phâk loh va a suan bo daih hma loh chuan an kalsan lo va. Chutichuan, Israel-hote chu anmahni ram ata Assuria ramah an hruai ta a, tûn thlengin an la awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lalin Babulon khuaa mite, Kutha khuaa mite, Ava khuaa mite, Hamath khuaa mite, Sepharvaim khuaa mite a chah chhuak a, Samari ram khuaahte chuan Israela thlahte hmun a luahtîr a; tichuan, Samari ram chu an luah a, a khuaahte chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, chuta an han awm tirh chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpa an ṭih lo va; chutichuan, Lalpan an zîngah sakeibakneite a tîr a, mi ṭhenkhat an seh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Assuria lal hnênah, “I suanho hnamte, Samari ram khua i luhtîrte hian hêng lai ram Pathian biak dân hi an hre ve lo va; chuvâng chuan an zîngah sakeibakneite a tîr ta a; tin, ngai teh, hêng lai ram Pathian biak dân an hriat ve loh avângin an seh ṭhîn a ni,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Assuria lal chuan, “Khata sala in hruaite zînga mi puithiam pakhat hruai ula, lo awm ve sela, chu ram Pathian biak dân chu zirtîr rawh se,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samari ram aṭanga an hruaite zînga puithiam pakhat chu Bethel khuaah a va awm a, Lalpa an ṭih dân tûr a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, hnam tin chuan mahni pathian thian an siam ṭheuh va, Samari miten hmun sâng an lo siam inahte chuan hnam tinin mahni awmna khua ṭheuhvah an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon mite chuan Sukkoth-benoth an siam a; tin, Kuth-ho chuan Nergal an siam a; tin, Hamath-ho chuan Asima an siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ava-ho chuan Nibhaz leh Tartak an siam a; tin, Sepharvaim-ho chuan Sepharvaim-ho pathian Adrammelek leh Anammelek hmingin an fate an hâl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chu an ṭih a, an zînga mi hmun sâng puithiamahte an insiam a, hmun sâng inahte chuan mi an thawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa chu an ṭih a, an hruai chhuahna rama mite hnam tih dân angin anmahni pathiante rawng chu an bâwl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tûn hma lama an tih dân angin tûn thlengin an la ti reng a ni; Lalpa chu an ṭih lo va, Lalpan Jakoba thlah Israel-te tia a vuahte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Pathian dangte chu ṭih suh ula, anmahni chu chibai bûk suh ula, an rawng bâwl suh ula, an hnênah inthawi suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa , thiltihtheihna nasa tak leh bân phar meuhva Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu che u amah chu in ṭih zâwk tûr a ni a, amah chu chibai in bûk tûr a ni a, ama hnênah in inthawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, thuruat te, rorêl te, dân te, thupêkte a lo ziaksak tâk che u kha kumkhuain in pawm reng tûr a ni a; pathian dangte chu in ṭih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, in hnêna thu ka thlun hi in theihnghilh tûr a ni lo; pathian dangte in ṭih tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian erawh chu in ṭih tûr a ni; tichuan, in hmêlma zawng zawngte kut ata chu a chhan chhuak ang che u,” tia thu a thluna, an tâna Lalpa thupêk te, thuruat te, rorêl te, dân siamte chu an zâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eng ti pawhin an pawm duh chuang lo va, tûn hma lama an tih dân angin an la ti reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, chûng hnamte chuan Lalpa zawng an ṭih a, an milem siam chawpte rawng pawh an bâwl bawk a; chutiang bawkin an thlahte leh an thlahte thlah thleng pawhin, tûn thleng hian an pi leh pute tih angin an la ti reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ela fapa Israel lal Hosea kum thum a lal kum chuan heti hi a ni a, Juda lal Ahaza fapa Hezekia chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal ṭan tirh chuan kum sawmhnih leh kum nga a ni; tin, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh kum kua a lal a; a nu hming chu Abii, Zekaria fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a pu Davida thiltih apiang ti vein Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmun sângte a thehthang bo va, lungphunte a tichim a, Aseri-te a kit a; tin, Mosia dâr rûl siamte chu a tikeh sawm vek a; chûng lai hun thleng chuan Israela thlahten a hnênah rimtui an hâl ṭhîn a ni; chu chu Nehustan an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu a ring a; chutichuan, a hnua Juda lal zawng zawng zîngah amah ang tu mah an awm lo va, a hmaah pawh an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu a vuan tlat a, amah a zui chu a bâng duh lo va, a thupêk Lalpan Mosia a pêkte chu a zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu a hnênah a awm a; a chhuahvahna apiangah a hmuingîl zêl a. Assuria lal chungah a hel a, a rawng a bâwl ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philistia-hote chu Gaza khaw thlengin a ram chin zawng zawng nên, râlvêngtute in sâng aṭanga kulh nei khaw thlengin a hneh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lal Hezekia kum li a lal kum, Israel lal Ela fapa Hosea kum sarih a lal kum chuan heti hi a ni a, Assuria lal Salmanesera chuan Samari khua a han bei a, a han hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, kum thum a vei kumin an la ta a; Hezekia kum ruk a lal kum, Israel lal Hosea kum kua a lal kumin a ni, Samari khua chu an lâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa an Pathian thu chu an pawm duh lohva, a thuthlung chu an bawhchhiat zâwka, Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Mosia thu a pêk zawng zawngte ngei kha an pawm duh loh va an tih duh loh avângin, Assuria lal chuan Israel-hote chu Assuria ramah a hruai a, Hala ramah te, Gozan rama Habor luiah te, Media-ho khuaahte a awmtîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lal Hezekia kum sâwm leh kum li a kal kumin, Assuria ram lal Senakeriba chu Judai rama khua kulhpui nei zawng zawng bei tûrin a han chho va, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Hezekia chuan Lakis khuaa Assuria lal hnênah chuan, “Thil ka lo tisual ta a ni e; mi kiansan leh mai rawh; i mi tuk apiang chu ka pe zêl ang e,” tiin thu a thawn a. Tin, Assuria lal chuan Juda lal Hezekia chu tangkarua talent zathum leh rangkachak talent sawmthum a tuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekia chuan Lalpa ina tangkarua awm zawng zawng leh lal ina ro dah khâwmnaa mi zawng zawng chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi ṭum ngei chuan Hezekia chuan Lalpa biak in kawngkhâra mi leh, Juda lal Hezekian bana rangkachak a luante chu a la thla vek a, Assuria lal a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal chuan Tartan te, Rabsari te leh Rabsake te sipai tam tak nên Lakis khua aṭangin Jerusalem khuaa Lal Hezekia hnênah chuan a tîr a. Tin, Jerusalem khua chu an han thleng a. Tin, an han thlen chuan Puansutu Phûl kalkawnga dîl chhakta zâwk tuilâkna kiangah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chu an han auh chuan, in chhûng lam hotu Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, lehkhaziaktu Sebna te, chanchin ziaktu Asapha fapa Joa te chu an hnênah an va chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Rabsakea chuan an hnênah, “Hezekia hnênah han sawi rawh u khai, ‘Lal ropui tak Assuria lal chuan heti hian a ti: I rin i nghahna hi eng nge ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Indona atân chuan remruat thiamna leh chakna kan nei a ni, i ti a; nimahsela, chu chu ṭawngka mai a ni. Tu nge i rina ka chunga i hel tâk ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai teh, he luang sâwp tiang, Aigupta hi i ring ta a ni a; chu chu miin a rinchhan chuan a kutah a chhun ang; Aigupta lal Pharaoa chu amah ringtu zawng zawng chungah chuan chutiang chu a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nih loh leh ka hnênah, “ Lalpa kan Pathian chu a ni kan rin ni,” in tih chuan, ani chu Hezekian Juda-ho leh Jerusalem-ho hnêna, “Jerusalem khuaa he maichâm hmaah hian in be tûr a ni,” tia a hmun sângte leh a maichâmte a lâk bosaka kha a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ ‘Chutichuan, ka pu Assuria lal nên chuan thu intiam rawh u khai; tichuan, sakawr sânghnih ka pe ang che, a chunga chuang tûrte i hmuh theih dâwn phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Engtin nge tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite thûah Aigupta chunga i rinna nghatin, ka pu mite zînga tê ber hotu pakhat pawh hi i dan kîr zawh dâwn tehlul ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, he ram hi Lalpa thu lova tichhe tûra lo chho em ka nih? Lalpan chu ram chu han beia, tichhe tûrin min hrilh a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Hilkia fapa Eliakima leh Sebna leh Joa-te chuan Rabsakea hnênah, “Khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawhte hi Suria ṭawngin min be tawh zâwk rawh, chu chu kan hre thei si a; kulh chunga mite beng hriatah hian Juda ṭawngin min be tawh suh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Rabsakea chuan an hnênah, “Ka pu chuan in pu hnên leh in hnên chauhvah hêng thu hi sawi tûrin mi tîr em ni? Kulh chunga ṭhuho, nangni leh anni, mahni êk la ei tûr leh mahni zun la in tûrte hnênah hian mi tîr bawk a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Rabsakea chu a ding a, Juda ṭawngin aw ring takin a au va, “Lal ropui tak Assuria lal thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal chuan heti hian a ti: Hezekia bumin awm suh u; ani chuan a kut ata a chhan him thei dâwn si lo che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekia chuan, ‘ Lalpan min chhan him ngei ang a; tin, he khawpui hi Assuria lal kutah pêk a ni lo vang,’ tiin Lalpa chu rintîr che u suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekia thu chu pawm suh u; Assuria lal chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Min rem ula, ka hnênah hian lo chhuak rawh u; tin, nangmahni ram anga buh leh uain ram, chhang leh grêp huan ram, olive leh khawizu ram, thi lova in nun theihna tûr rama ka rawn hruai hma loh che u chuan mi tinin mahni grêp hruiha mi leh mi tinin mahni theipui kûnga mi ei ṭheuh ula, mi tinin mahni tuikhur tui tlân ṭheuh rawh u. Hezekian, Lalpan min chhan him ang, tia a thlêm che u pawhin pawm duh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hnam tinte pathian zawng zawng zînga mi rêng rêngin an ram chu Assuria lal lakah an chhan him tawh ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad pathiante kha khawiah nge an awm tâk? Sepharvaim te, Hena te, Iva te pathiante pawh kha khawiah nge an awm tâk? Samari khua kha ka lakah an chhan him em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ram tin pathian zawng zawng zînga mi chuan tute nge an ram ka laka chhanhima, Lalpa chuan Jerusalem khua hi ka lakah a han chhan him tehlul ang?’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Anni erawh chu an ngawi reng a, kam khat mahin an chhâng lo; lal thupêk dân chu, “Ani chu chhâng suh u,” tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal in chhûng lam hotu Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, lehkhaziaktu Sebna te, chanchin ziaktu Asapha fapa Joa te chu an silhfên pawh thlêrte inbelin Hezekia hnênah chuan an kal a, Rabsakea thusawite chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lal Hezekia chuan chu chu a hriatin heti hi a ni a, a silhfênte chu a pawt thlêr a, saiip puan a inbel a, Lalpa inah chuan a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, in chhûng lam hotu Eliakima leh, lehkhaziaktu Sebna leh, puithiam upate chu saiip puan inbelin Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Hezekian heti hian a ti: ‘Vawiin ni hi manganna leh zilhhauna leh hmingchhiatna ni a ni; nautê chu an pian a hun tawh si a, hring tûrin chakna a awm tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pu Assuria lalin Pathian nung sawi chhe tûra a tirh Rabsakea thusawi zawng zawng chu Lalpa i Pathian chuan a hria ang a, a thusawi, Lalpa i Pathianin a hriata chu a la zilhhau mahna. Chumi avâng chuan a la awm chhunte chu ṭawngṭaisak rawh,’ a ti e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Hezekia mite chu Isaia hnênah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isaia chuan an hnênah, “In pu hnênah heti hian sawi ang che u, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “I thu hriat, Assuria lal miten mi sawichhiatnate kha hlau suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, a kawchhûngah thlarau ka awmtîr ang a, thuthang a hria ang a, ama ramah a haw leh ang; tichuan, ama ram ngeiah khandaiha tihthlûkin ka awmtîr ang,” a ti e,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Rabsakea chu a kîr leh a, Assuria lal chuan Libna khua a lo beih lai a va hmu a; Lakis khua ata chu a chhuak tih a hre tawh rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, “Ngai teh, nangmah bei tûrin a chhuak ta,” tia Tirhaka, Ethiopia ram lal chungchâng thu mi sawi a lo hriat chuan Hezekia hnênah mite a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Heti hian Juda lal Hezekia hnênah sawi ang che u: ‘I Pathian, i rina chuan, “Jerusalem khua chu Assuria lal kutah pêk a ni lo vang,” tiin bum che suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, Assuria lalten ram zawng zawng tichhe veka a chunga an thiltihte kha i hria a; nang hi chhan him i ni dâwn bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnam tin pathiante chuan ka pi leh puten an tihboralte kha an chhan him em ni? Gozan te, Haran te, Rezeph te, Eden fa Telasar khuaa awmte kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath lal te, Arpad lal te, Sepharvaim khawpui lal te, Hena lal te, Iva lal te kha khawiah nge an awm tâk?’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan a mi tirhte kut ata lehkha chu a hmu a, a han chhiar a; tichuan, Hezekia chu Lalpa inah chuan a han lût a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a pharh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chu Lalpa hmaah a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , cherub-te chunga ṭhu Israela Pathian, nang, nang chauh hi leilung ram zawng zawng Pathian chu i ni; lei leh vân hi nangma siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i beng lo chhi la, ngaithla teh; Pathian nung sawi chhe tûra Senakeriban thu a rawn sawi hi ngaithla teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , Assuria lalten hnamte leh an ramte chu an tichhe ṭhîn tak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />an pathiante chu meiah an paih bawk ṭhîn a: chûngte chu pathian an ni lo rêng a, mihring kuta siam, thing leh lung an ni zâwk a. Chuvângin, an tiboral a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Lalpa kan Pathian, nang, nangmah chauh hi Lalpa Pathian i ni tih leilung luah ram zawng zawng hian an hriat theih nân, a lakah hian min chhandam ngei ngei ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Amoza fapa Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israela Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Assuria lal Senakeriba chhiatna tûr lama ka hnêna i ṭawngṭai kha ka lo hria e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi a chungchâng thu Lalpan a sawi chu a ni: ‘Zion fanu nula chuan a hmusit chia, a nuihzatbûr che; Jerusalem fanu chuan a lû a thin khum che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu nge i tihhmingchhiata, i sawi chhiat? Tu chungah nge i aw i tihpâwra, i mit i lek sân? Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chungah alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I mi tirhte hmangin Lalpa chu i tihmingchhia a, “Ka tawlailîr tam tak nên Lebanon ram ril tlâng sângte ka lo thleng chho ta a; chuta sidar thing sâng takte leh fâr thing ṭha ṭhate chu ka kit ang a; a lei ṭha hmun ram ngaw, a chênna hmun ril berah chuan ka lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram dang tui ka lai chhuak a, ka tlân ṭhîn a, ka kephah hnuai hian Aigupta lui zawng zawng chu ka tikang vek ang,” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keiman hmânlai ata chûng chu ka tih a nihzia te, hmasâng ata chûng chu ka siam a nihzia te i hre lo vem ni? Khaw kulh neite chu in chim khâwm ang maia tichhetu atân ka ruat ta che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a chhûnga awmte chu chakna an nei lo va, an zâm a, an lo mualpho tâk kha; phûl hlobet ang leh, hnim hring ang leh, in chunga hlobet ang leh, buh a len hmaa thli em vuai ang an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kei chuan i ṭhut te, i luh leh i chhuah te, ka chunga i thinurte hi ka hria asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka chunga i thinur avâng leh, i ṭawng chaltlai chu ka bengah a lo luh chhoh tâk avâng hian ka hnârvuah chu i hnârah ka vuah ang a, ka thîrbarh chu i hmuiah, i lo kalna kawng ngeiah khân ka kîrtîr leh ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, hei hi i tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang: kuminah buhhli in ring ang a, nakkumah a hli bawk; tin, a kum thumnaah chuan buhte tuh ula, ât ula, grêp huante siam ula, a rahte ei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda chhûngte zînga la dam chhunte chuan a chhuk zâwngin zung an kai ang a, a chho zâwngin an rah leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭangin a la awm chhunte, Zion tlâng aṭangin a la damte chu an chhuak dâwn a ni. Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan chûng chu a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan Assuria lal chungchâng thu chu heti hian a sawi: ‘He khawpui hi a lo thleng lo vang a, hetah hian thal a kâp hek lo vang, phaw nên a kiangah a lo kal hek lo vang a, a khaw hrûlah lei an tiang pâwng hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lo kalna kawngah, chumiah ngei chuan a lêt leh ang a, he khawpui hi a lo thleng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keimah avâng leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin he khawpui hi chhan him tûrin ka vêng dâwn a ni,’ Lalpan a ti,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi zân chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a thawk chhuak a, Assuria-ho riahhmunah chuan mi nuai khat leh sîngriat leh sângnga a tihlum a; tin, zîng taka an han thawh chuan, ngai teh, mitthi ruang hlîr a lo ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, Assuria lal Senakeriba chu a chhuak a, a lêt leh a, a kal leh ta zêl a, Ninevi khuaah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a pathian Nisroka inah chuan amah a biak laiin heti hi a ni a, a fapate Adrammeleka leh Sarezera-te chuan khandaihin an tihlum a; tichuan, Ararat ramah an tlân bo ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Esar-haddona chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Hezekia chu thih ngamin a nâ a. Tichuan, Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia chu a hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I chhûngte awm dân tûr sawi rawh khai, i dam chhuak zo dâwn si lo va,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, bang lam hawiin a let a, Lalpa hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , i hmaah thutak leh thinlung ṭha famkim pua ka awm ṭhinzia leh, i mit hmuha thil ṭha ka tih ṭhinzia kha khawngaih takin hre reng ang che,” tiin a ṭawngṭai a. Tin, Hezekia chu a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isaia chuan khawpui lai tak pawh chu a thlen hmain heti hi a ni a, Lalpa thu a hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kîr leh la, ka mite hotu Hezekia hnênah sawi rawh, ‘ Lalpa , i pu Davida Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “I ṭawngṭaina kha ka hria a, i mittui tla pawh ka hmu e; ngai teh, ka tidam ang chia, ni thum nîah chuan Lalpa inah i han kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, i dam chhûng kumte hi kum sâwm leh kum ngain ka tisei ang a; tin, nang leh he khawpui hi Assuria lal lakah ka chhan him ang a; tin, keimah avâng leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin he khawpui hi ka hum ang,” a ti,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Isaian, “Theipui rah khâwn khat han la rawh u” a ti a. Tichuan, an rawn la a, khawihliah chuan an bel a, a lo dam leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan Isaia hnênah, “ Lalpan mi tidam ang a, Lalpa inah a ni thum niin ka han kal ang tih chhinchhiahna eng nge ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isaian, “ Lalpan a thil sawi hi a ti ngei dâwn tih hei hi i tân Lalpa laka chhinchhiahna tûr chu a ni ang: hlim chu rahka sâwm thlenga a tawlh chhoh nge i duh rahka sâwm thlenga a tawlh kîr?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan a chhâng a, “Hlim chu rahka sâwm thlenga a tawlh chhoh chu a awl êm a, chu zawng ni lo ve, hlim chu rahka sâwm thlengin tawlh kîr zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, zâwlnei Isaia chuan Lalpa a han au va; tin, Ahaza dâr chin hriatnaa hlim hniam tawh chu rahka sâwm thlengin a tikîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Baladana fapa Babulon lal Merodak-baladana chuan lehkhate leh lâwmpuinate Hezekia a thawn a, Hezekia chu a nâ tih a hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekia chuan anni chu a lo lâwm a, a thil hlu dahna in zawng zawng te, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, englo rimtui te, hriak hlu tak te, a râlthuam dahna in chhûng te, a ro awm zawng zawngte chu a entîr a. A ina mi leh a ram chhûnga mi Hezekian a entîr loh rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan zâwlnei Isaia chu Lal Hezekia hnênah a kal a, a hnênah, “Kha mite khân eng nge an sawi? Khawi aṭangin nge i hnênah an lo kal?” a ti a. Tin, Hezekia chuan, “Ram hla tak, Babulon aṭangin an lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “I inah hian eng eng nge an hmuh?” a ti a. Tin, Hezekia chuan, “Ka in chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu an hmu vek a, ka ro zînga mi ka entîr loh rêng rêng a awm lo,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa thu hi lo ngaithla rawh khai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, i in chhûnga awm zawng zawng leh vawiin thlenga i pi leh puten an lo khâwl khâwmte chu Babulon khuaa an kalpui nite a lo la thleng ang; eng mah rêng rêng hnutchhiah a awm lo vang,’ Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Tin, i rîla rah, i hrin tûr, i fate ngei zînga mi pawh an kal bopui ang a; Babulon lal inah chuan mi tilreh an la ni ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekia chuan Isaia hnênah, “I sawi Lalpa thu hi a ṭha e,” a ti a. Tin, “Ka dam chhûng hian remna leh thutak a awm dâwn phawt chuan,” a ti leh nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekia chanchin dang te, a thiltihtheihzia zawng zawng te, dîl leh tuilâkna a siama, khawpui chhûnga tui a lâk luh thute chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Manasea chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasea chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sâwm leh kum hnih mi a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh kum nga a lal a. A nu hming chu Hephzibi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israela thlahte hmaa a hnawh chhuah tâk hnamten thil tenawm tak an tih ṭhin ang, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo takte chu a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekian a tihchhiat tawh hmun sângte chu a din leh a; Israel lal Ahaba tih angin Baala maichâmte a din a, Aseri te a siam a, vâna awm zawng zawng khi a bia a, an rawng a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan , “Jerusalem-ah ka hming ka awmtîr ang,” a tihna Lalpa inah chuan maichâmte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in hung chhûng kawtlai pahnihah chuan vâna awm zawng zawng tân maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a fapa chu meiah a luhtîr a, aien te a chîng a, dawi te a hmang a, ramhuai aienthiam zâwlte leh dawithiamte a ruai ṭhîn a. Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo nasa tak, a tithinrim tûrin a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin Lalpan Davida leh a fapa Solomona hnêna, “He in leh Jerusalem khua, Israel chi zawng zawng zînga ka thlanah hian ka hming chu kumkhuain ka awmtîr ang a; thu ka pêk ang zawng zawng leh ka chhiahhlawh Mosian dân a pêk ang zawng zawng kha an pawm phawt chuan an pi leh pute ka pêk tawh ram ata chu Israel-te kete pawh hi ka pên chhuahtîr tawh bawk hek lo vang,” a lo tih tawh inah chuan Aseri lem a siam chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, an pawm duh lo va; Lalpan Israela thlahteho hmaa a hnawh chhuah tâk hnamte tih ai maha nasa zâwk thil tisual tûrin, Manasea chuan mite a thlêm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmangin thu a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Juda lal Manasea hian hêng thil tenawm takte hi a ti a, a hmaa Amor-hote ai mahin a tisual nasa a, Juda-ho hi a milemtein thil a tihsualtîr avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh u, Jerusalem leh Juda chungah hian a hria apiangte beng khing hnih ṭhâwng khawp thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlentîr dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samari tehna hrui leh Ahaba chhûng dârmûmkhai chu Jerusalem chungah ka zam ang a; miin thlêng a hru a, a tilinglet ang maiin Jerusalem chu ka hru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka ro chan la awm chhunte chu ka paih thla ang a, an hmêlmate kutah ka pe ang; tichuan, an pi leh pute Aigupta rama an lo chhuah ata vawiin thleng hian ka mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak an ti a, mi tihthinrim avâng hian an hmêlma zawng zawngte man tûr leh râllâk tûr an ni ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak tia Juda-te thil a tihsualtîra sualna tiam lovin Manasea chuan pawi khawih lo thisen nasa takin a chhuah bawk a, Jerusalem dung leh vâng a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Manasea chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, a thil tihsualte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Manasea chu a pi leh pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, Uza huana ama in bul huanah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Amona chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amona chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum hnih a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum hnih a lal a. A nu hming chu Mesulemethi, Jotba khuaa Haruza fanu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a pa Manasea tih ang bawk Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ve ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pa kawng zawh zawng zawng chu a zawh ve a, a pain milem rawng a bâwl te chu a bâwl a, chibai a bûk ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa , a pi leh pute Pathian chu a kalsan a; Lalpa kawng chu a zawh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Amona miten amah an phiarru a, lal chu ama inah an tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi rama mite chuan Lal Amona phiarrutu zawng zawng chu an tihlum ta vek a. Tichuan, chumi rama mite chuan a fapa Josia chu a aiawhin lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Amona thiltih dangte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Uza huana ama thlânah an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Josia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum riat mi a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sawmthum leh kum khat a lal a. A nu hming chu Jedidi, Bozkath khuaa Adaia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil fel tak a ti ṭhîn a, a pu Davida kawng zawh zawng zawng chu a zawh ve a, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw a pênsan lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lal Josia a lal kum sâwm leh kum riat kumin heti hi a ni a, lal chuan Mesulama fa Azalia fapa lehkhaziaktu Saphana chu a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Puithiam lalber Hilkia hnênah han kal la, kawngkhâr vêngtuten mite hnên ata an lo lâk khâwm Lalpa ina tangka an rawn dah chu chhiar sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in satu hnathawktute pe rawh se; tin, anni chuan in chhe siamtu, Lalpa ina hnathawkho pe rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thingrem siamtu te, in satu te, in chhe siamtute chuan in chhe lai siamna thing leh lungchher an lei theih nân,” tiin Lalpa inah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tangka an pêkate chu an en zuipui leh chuang lêm lo; rinawm taka an tih ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber Hilkia chuan lehkhaziaktu Saphana hnênah, “ Lalpa inah dân lehkhabu chu ka chhar ta e,” a ti a. Tin, Hilkia chuan lehkhabu chu Saphana a pe a, ani chuan a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu Saphana chu lal hnênah a kal a, lal hnênah thu chu a va thlen leh a, “I mite chuan ina tangka awm chu an pe chhuak vek a, Lalpa in satu hnathawktute an pe vek ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu Saphana chuan, “Puithiam Hilkian lehkhabu mi lo pe asin,” tiin lal chu a hrilh a. Tin, Saphana chuan lal hmaah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, lalin dân lehkhabu thute chu a han hriat chuan heti hi a ni a, a puante a pawt thlêr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan puithiam Hilkia te, Saphana fapa Ahikama te, Mikaia fapa Akbora te, lehkhaziaktu Saphana te, lal mi Asaia te hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kei leh, mipui leh, Juda-ho zawng zawng hi he lehkhabu chhara thu chuang thûah hian Lalpa min va râwnsak teh u; kan tih tûra hemi lehkhabua ziak ang zawng zawng hi kan pi leh puten an lo zawm loh avângin kan chungah hian Lalpa thinurna chu a alh nasat tawh êm hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam Hilkia te, Ahikama te, Akbora te, Saphana te, Asaia te chu silhfên enkawltu Harhasa fa Tikva fapa Saluma nupui zâwlnei Huldi hnênah chuan an kal a, an va bia a. (Ani chu Jerusalem Misne-a awm a ni a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: ‘Ka hnêna rawn tîrtu che u hi hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti e: “Ngai teh, hemi hmunah leh, a chhûnga chênghote chungah hian thil ṭha lo tak ka rawn thlentîr dâwn a ni, Juda lalin lehkhabua a thu chhiar zawng zawng ang kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mi kalsana, pathian dangte hnênah rimtui an hâla, an kutchhuaka mi tihthinrim avângin hemi hmunah hian ka thinurna a alh nasa dâwn a, a mit mai dâwn lo ve.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa râwn tûra rawn tîrtu che u Juda lal hnênah chuan hetiang hian sawi ang che u: ‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: “I thu hriat chungchâng thûah chuan -
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hemi hmun leh, a chhûnga chêngte hi tihṭiau leh ânchhe dawngin an la awm ang tih thu ka sawi kha i lo hriata, i rilru te a nêma, Lalpa hmaa i inngaihtlâwma, i puante i pawh thlêra, ka hmaa i ṭah avângin, kei pawhin i thu chu ka lo hria e,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngai teh, i pi leh pute hnênah ka hruai ang chia, i thlânah thlamuang taka hruaiin i awm ang a, hemi hmuna thil ṭha lo tak ka rawn thlentîr tûr chu i mitin a hmu vek hek lo vang, a ti e,’ tiin,” a ti a. Tichuan, thu chu lal hnênah an va thlen leh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan mite a tîr a, Judai ram leh Jerusalem khawpuia upa zawng zawng a hnênah a ko khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chu Judai rama mi zawng zawng nên, Jerusalem khuaa mi zawng zawng nên, puithiamte leh zâwlneite nên, mipui zawng zawng nên a lian a têin Lalpa inah chuan an han chho va; tin, Lalpa ina an lehkhabu chhara thuthlung bua chuang zawng zawng chu an beng hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chu ban hrûlah a ding a, chumi lehkhabua chuang thuthlung thu chu tinghet tûrin, thinlung zawng zawng leh thlarau zawng zawnga Lalpa zui tûr leh, a thupêkte, a thuhriattîrte, a thuruatte pawm tûrin Lalpa hmaah chuan thu a thlung a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng pawhin an thlunpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lalin puithiam lalber Hilkia te, a dawttu puithiam te, kawngkhâr vêngtute chu Lalpa biak in chhûnga Baala leh, Aseri leh, vâna thil awmho zawng zawng tâna siam bungbêl zawng zawng chu la chhuak vek tûrin thu a pe a; tichuan, Jerusalem pâwn lam, Kidron phûlah a hâl a, a vâp chu Bethel-ah a kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, milem beho puithiamte, Juda lalten Judai ram khawpui hmun sângahte, Jerusalem vêla rimtui hâl tûra an lo ruatte chu a bântîr a; Baala tân te, ni tân te, thla tân te, arsi tân te, vâna awmho zawng zawng tântea rimtui hâltute pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina Aseri chu Jerusalem pâwn lam, Kidron luiah a la chhuak a, Kidron luiah chuan a hâl a, a rap sawm dep a, a dip chu mi narânte thlânah a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Aseri puan tahho hmeichhe awmna, Lalpa ina mipa inzuarho awmna inte chu a ṭhiatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Juda khawpui atate chu puithiam zawng zawng a hruai chhuak a, puithiamhote rimtui hâlna hmun sângte chu Geba aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin a tibawrhbâng vek a; khawpui kawngka luha vei lampang, khawpui awptu Josua Kawngka luhna kawngkatea hmun sângte chu a tichim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmun sâng puithiamte chu Jerusalem-a Lalpa maichâmah an han chho ve lo na a, an unaute zîngah chhang dawidim telh loh erawh chu an ei ve ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, tu mahin an fapa emaw, an fanu emaw Moleka puala meia an luhtîr tawh lohna tûrin, Hinoma thlahte ruama Topheth chu a tibawrhbâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in luhnaa a in hual chhûnga lal in vêngtu Nathan-meleka pindan bula Juda lalten ni tâna sakawr an pêkte chu a suan bo vek a; ni tawlailîrte chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Ahaza in chhâwng chunga Juda lalten maichâm an siamte leh Manasean Lalpa in hung chhûng kawtlai pahniha maichâm a siamte chu lal chuan a tichim a, a tisawm berh a, a nawite chu Kidron luiah a paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem bul chhiatna tlâng ding lampanga Zidon-ho pathian tenawm tak Astarothi tân te, Moab-ho pathian tenawm tak Kemosa tân te, Amona thlahte pathian tenawm tak Milkoma tân te, Israel lal Solomonan hmun sâng a siamte chu lal chuan a tibawrhbâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lungphunte chu a tikeh sawm vek a, Aseri-te chu a kit a, chûng hmunahte chuan mihring ruh a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chu lo pawh chu Israel-te thil tihsualtîrtu Nebata fapa Jeroboaman Bethel-a maichâm leh hmun sâng a siam chu, chumi maichâm leh hmun sâng lamin a tichim bawk a; tichuan, hmun sâng chu a hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Josia chu a han hawi a, tlânga thlânte chu a han hmu a; tichuan, thlâna ruhte chu a va lâktîr a, chûng thu lo sawitu Pathian miin a lo sawi, Lalpa thu ang ngeiin maichâmah chuan a hâl a, a tibawrhbâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “Saw, tu lungphun nge ka han hmuh saw?” a ti a. Tin, khuaa mite chuan, “Pathian mi, Judai ram aṭanga lo kal, Bethel-a maichâm chunga i tih tâk hi lo sawi lâwktu thlân a nih saw,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Eng mah tih suh u; tu mahin a ruhte chu la sawn suh se,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a ruhte chu Samari ram aṭanga zâwlnei lo kala ruhte nên eng mah an tih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Israel lalten Lalpa tithinrima an sak Samari ram khuatea hmun sâng in zawng zawng pawh chu Josia chuan a suan bo va, Bethel khuaa a tih ang chiahin a tihsak ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, chuta hmun sâng puithiam awm zawng zawng chu maichâm chungah a that a, chûngah chuan mihring ruhte a hâl a, Jerusalem-ah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan mi zawng zawng hnênah, “He thuthlung bua chuang ang hian Lalpa , in Pathian tân Kalhlên Kût nei rawh u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel-te chunga rorêltuten ro an rêl achin, Israel lalte lal chhûng zawng zawng te, Juda lalte lal chhûng zawng zawng te pawhin chutiang taka Kalhlên Kût chu an la nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal Josia lal kum sâwm leh kum riat kumah chuan chu Kalhlên Kût chu Jerusalem khuaah Lalpa tân an nei ta chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina puithiam Hilkian a chhar lehkhabua dân thu chuangte kha a tihngheh theih nân ramhuai aienthiam zâwl te, dawithiam te, pathian lem te, milem te, Judai ram leh Jerusalem khuaa thil tenawm an hmuh ṭhin zawng zawng chu Josia chuan a tibo vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia dân zawng zawng anga thinlung zawng zawng leh thlarau zawng zawng leh chakna zawng zawnga Lalpa pawm, amah ang rêng rêng a hmaa lal tu mah an awm lo va, a hnuah pawh amah ang chu tu mah an awm leh tawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin Lalpa chuan a thinrimna nasa tak, Manasean a lo tihthinrimna zawng zawng avânga Juda chunga a thinrimna alh chu a la tireh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan , “Israel ka sawn bo ang hian Juda pawh hi ka hmuh phâk lohvah ka sawn bo ve ang a, he khua ka thlan Jerusalem ngei leh, ‘Chutah chuan ka hming chu a awm ang,’ ka tih in hi ka thehthang bo daih ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Josia chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte lal lai chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A lal lai chuan Aigupta lal Pharao-nekoa chu Assuria lal bei tûrin Euphrates luiah a han chho va; tin, Lal Josia chuan ani chu a lo bei a. Tin, Pharao-nekoa chuan amah chu a hmuh veleh Megido khuaah a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a mite chuan Megido aṭang chuan a ruang chu tawlailîrin an kalpui a, Jerusalem-ah an luhpui a, ama thlânah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, chumi rama mite chuan Josia fapa Jehoahaza chu an hruai a, hriak an thih a, a pa aiah lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaza chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum thum a ni a; Jerusalem-ah thla thum a lal a. A nu hming chu Hamutali, Libna khuaa Jeremia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a pi leh pute tih dân ang zawng zawng Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Pharao-nekoa chuan Jerusalem-a rorêl thei tawh lo tûrin Hamath rama Ribla khuaah a tântîr a; tin, an ram chu tangkarua talent zakhat leh rangkachak talent khat a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Pharao-nekoa chuan Josia fa Eliakima chu a pa Josia aiah a laltîr a, a hming chu Jehoiakima tiin a thlâksak a; Jehoahaza erawh chu a hruai daih a, Aigupta ramah a kal a, chutah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiakima chuan tangkarua leh rangkachak chu Pharaoa a pe phawt a; an ramte chu Pharaoa thupêk angin a tangkaa pe tûrin chhiah a chawitîr ve thung a; Pharao-nekoa hnêna pêk tûrin mi tin chawi tûra a tuk zât ṭheuh ang zêlin chumi rama mite ta tangkarua leh rangkachak a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakima chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum nga a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal a. A nu hming chu Zebidi, Ruma khuaa Pedaia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a pi leh pute tih dân ang zawng zawng Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lal lai chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara a lo lian a, Jehoiakima chu chhiah khuaah kum thum a awm a; chumi hnuah chuan a hawisan a, a chungah a hel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Kaldai pâwl tê te, Suria pâwl tê te, Moab pâwl tê te, Amona thlah pâwl tê te amah bei tûrin a tîr chhuak a; a chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmanga a sawi Lalpa thu angin Judai ram tihchhiattîr tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasea thiltih zawng zawng, a thil tihsual leh pawi khawih lo thisen a chhuaha, Jerusalem chu pawi khawih lo thisena a tihkhah avângin, a hmuh phâk loh va suan bo tûr thu Juda chungah Lalpa thuin a lo thleng ta ngei a, Lalpan a ngaidam duh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehoiakima chanchin dang leh a thiltih zawng zawng chu Juda lalte lal lai chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehoiakima chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a. Tin, a fapa Jehoiakina chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal chu a ram ata a lo chhuak leh ta lo va, Babulon lal chuan Aigupta ram luitê aṭanga Euphrates lui thlenga Aigupta lalram huam zawng zawng a la tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakina chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sâwm leh kum riat a ni a; Jerusalem-ah thla thum a lal a. A nu hming chu Nehusti, Jerusalem khuaa Elnathana fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a pa tih dân ang zawng zawng tiin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara mite chu Jerusalem-ah an han chho va, khua chu an han hual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chutia a miten an han hual lai chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chu khuaah a han kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tichuan, Juda lal Jehoiakina chu a nu te, mi te, a mi lian te, a puipate nên chuan Babulon lal hnênah an va chhuak a; tin, a lal kum riat kumin Babulon lal chuan a man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa sawi ang khân Lalpa ina ro zawng zawng leh lal ina ro zawng zawng chu a la chhuak a, Lalpa biak ina Israel-te lal Solomonan rangkachak bungbêl a siam zawng zawng chu a sât sawm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawng - mi lian zawng zawng te, mi chak huaisen ṭha zawng zawng te, sîngkhat zet, mi themthiam leh thîrdêng zawng zawng nên a hruai vek a; chumi rama mi, a rethei theite tih loh chu tu mah an awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiakina chu Babulon-ah a hruai a. Lal nu te, lal nupui te, a puipa te, chumi rama mi chakte chu Jerusalem aṭangin Babulon-ah salah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal chuan pasalṭha zawng zawng sângsarih zet leh, themthiam leh thîrdêng sângkhat, mi chak ṭha zawng indo thei mi ṭhiau chu Babulon-ah salah a hruai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiakina pa unau Matania chu Babulon lal chuan a aiah a laltîr a, a hming chu Zedekia tiin a thlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum khat a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal a. A nu hming chu Hamutali, Libna khuaa Jeremia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiakima tih dân ang zawng zawng tiin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa thinurna avângin a hmuh phâk loh va a thehthang bo thlengin, Jerusalem leh Juda chungah thil a lo thleng zêl a ni. Zedekia chu Babulon lal chungah chuan a hel ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a lal kum ruk kum, thla sâwmna, ni sâwm ni takin heti hi a ni a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chuan a sipai zawng zawng nên Jerusalem a han bei a, awm hmun an han khuar a; tin, kulhin an hual vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Zedekia lal kum sâwm leh kum khatna thlengin khua chu an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla lina, ni kua ni chuan khua chu an ṭâm ta êm êm a, chuta mite tân chuan ei tûr rêng rêng a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, khawpui kulh chu an tipawp a; tichuan, zânah indo mi zawng zawng chu lal huan bul, kulh bang pahnih inkâra kulh kawngkaah an tlânchhe ta vek a (Kaldai-ho chuan khua chu an hual vêl a ni a). Tin, lal chu Araba kawng lamah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Kaldai sipaihote chuan lal chu an ûm a, Jeriko phaiah an ûm phâk a; a sipai zawng zawng chuan an tlân darhsan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chu an man a, Babulon lal hnênah Ribla khuaah an hruai a; tin, a chungchâng an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Zedekia fapate chu a mit hmuh ngeiah an that a, Zedekia mitte chu an kher chhuahsak a, kawl an buntîr a, Babulon-ah an kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Babulon lal, Lal Nebukadnezzara lal kum kuana, thla ngana, ni sarih ni chuan Babulon lal mi, vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chu Jerusalem-ah a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa in leh lal in chu a hâl a; Jerusalem in zawng zawng, in ropui tak takte chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu pâwl hotu hnêna awm Kaldai sipai zawng zawng chuan Jerusalem vêla kulh chu an tichim vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, khawpui chhûnga mi la awm, inpeho Babulon lal hnêna inpete, mipui la awmte chu vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan salah a hruai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi rama a rethei theite zînga mi erawh chu vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan grêp hrui enkawltu atân leh lo nei mi atân a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina dâr bante leh, Lalpa ina hûnchhan leh dâr tuizem chu Kaldai-hote chuan an tikeh sawm vek a, a dâr chu Babulon-ah an kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, bêl te, vut lawhna te, khâwnvâr puan chehna te, fiante leh dâr bungbêl zawng zawng, rawngbâwl nâna an hmante chu an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mei lâkna te, maihûn te nên; vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan rangkachaka siamte chu a rangkachak chu a la a, tangkaruaa siamte chu a tangkarua chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomonan Lalpa in atân a siam ban pahnih leh dâr tuizem leh a hûnchhante chu, chûng hmanrua zawng zawnga dâr bûk zât chu hriat rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ban pakhat sân lam chu tawng sâwm leh tawng riat a ni a, a chhîpah chuan dârchhûnbâwk a awm a. Chumi chhûnbâwk san lam chu tawng thum a ni; chhûnbâwk vêl chuan ṭial chik chek leh pawmgranet a chuang a, dâr vek a ni. Chumi ang bawk chuan ban pakhat pawh chu ṭial chik chek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan puithiam lal Seraia leh a dawttu puithiam Zephania leh kawngkhâr vêngtu pathum a man a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />indo mite chunga hotu pakhat nên, lal hmêl hmu pha ṭhîn khawpui chhûnga la awm panga nên, mipuite hming ziaktu sipai hotu lehkhaziaktu nên, khawpui chhûnga la awm, chu rama mi sawmruk nên khawpui chhûng ata a man bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan a hruai a, Babulon lal hnênah Ribla khuaah a kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal chuan Hamath ram, Ribla khuaah chuan a lo tihlum a. Chutichuan, Juda chu a ram chhûng aṭanga sala hruai chhuahin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Judai rama a hnutchhiahte pawh chu an chungah chuan Saphana fa Ahikama fapa Gedalia chu awptuah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng leh an hoten Babulon lalin Gedalia awptuah a siam tih an hriat chuan Mizpe khuaah Gedalia hnênah an kal a, chûngte chu Nethania fapa Ismaela te, Karea fapa Johanana te, Netophath mi Tanhumetha fapa Seraia te, Maaka mi fapa Jaazania te, an hote nên an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Gedalia chuan chûng mite leh an hote hnênah chuan chhia a chham a, an hnênah, “Kaldai-ho chhiah khuaa awm hi hlau suh u. He ramah hian awm reng mai ula, Babulon lal thu hnuaiah awm rawh u; tichuan, in tân a ṭha dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, thla sarihnaah chuan heti hi a ni a, lal thlah, Elisama fa, Nethania fapa Ismaela chu mi sâwm hruaiin a kal a, Gedalia chu Mizpe khuaa Juda-te leh Kaldai-ho a hnêna awmte nên an bei a, an that ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawng a lian a têin sipai hotute nên an chhuak a, Aigupta ramah an kal ta a; Kaldai-hote chu an hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehoiakina sala a tân kum sawmthum leh kum sarihna, thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, ni sawmhnih leh ni sarih niin heti hi a ni a, Babulon lal Evil-merodaka a lal ṭan kumin Juda lal Jehoiakina chu tân in ata a hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hnênah ṭha takin thu a sawi a, Babulon-a lalho awm vete lalṭhutthlêng chungah chuan a lalṭhutthlêng chu a dah sâng ta bîk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jehoiakina chuan a tân in silhfênte chu a thlâk a, a dam chhûng zawng chuan lal hnênah chaw a kîl ve ta ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, a châwm nân a mamawh tâwk tûr lalin ni tin, a dam chhûng zawng chuan chanvo a siamsak reng a.
  </para>
</usx>
